<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Luk</book>
  <para style="h">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt">Luk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I lah ua kichientah a gintat a na um, tua silte mi tampiin athu gel ana tup uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Achiil a kipat a mit a mute leh thu nasemten ahing hil bangun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zatat umpen Theophilus aw, abul akipat in sil zousie theichienna bukimna nei in akizom diudeu a na kunga gel hoi kasa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuahileh tumasang lai a nang hing nakihil thute adih ngel ahina chi na theichien ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judia gam a leengpa Herod dam lai in, Abijah pawl a mi, amin Zakaria kichi siempu nasem khat a um a, tualeh azi khu Aaron tanute lah a khat ahia amin Elizabeth ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh ani un Pasian mitmu in dihtat tahin a um ua, gensiet beiin Mangpa thupiehte leh adan zousie zui in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Elizabeth a chiin ziehin ta anei sih ua, ani un kum upa lam ahi tuohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hia, apawlte uh bawldan dungzui a ama hun a Pasian masanga siempu nna asep lai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siempu dan dungzui in Mangpa biehinn alut chienga gimnamtui hal khu atan ahi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh gimnamtui akihal lai in mipite abawn un innpulangah thu ana ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa vansawlsieng khat gimnamtui halna maitam zietlam a dingin akungah ahing kilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Zakaria in ama amu tahin, amangbanga zauna in adimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh vansawlsiengin akungah, Zakaria, “Zau sin, na thungetna zah ahitah zieh in, na zi Elizabeth in tapa ahing neipieh dinga, amin Johan na hisah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh nang nuomin na kipah ding a, tualeh mi tampite ama pienziehin akipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa mitmuin ama milien ahi ding a, uoin leh zu mawngmawng adawn sih ding, tualeh anu sunga kipat nangawnin Hagau Siengthouin adim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate tampi Mangpa a Pasian uh langah akiheisah kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh pate lungtang tate lam a kiheisah ding leh thumangloute midihtat pilna lam a kihei sah ding, tualeh Mangpa ding a mite kimansa a umsah dinga na bawlmasa ding in, Elijah lungsim leh silbawltheina toh Mangpa mai ah apei ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zakaria in vansawlsieng kungah, “Tami bangchin ka thei thei diei? Kei lah tehsie hita ing a, ka zi zong ateh mama tahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng in adawnga, akungah, “Kei Gabriel Pasian masanga ding zel ka hi; na kunga thu gen ding leh tam thu kipah huoite hil dinga sawl ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Ngai in, ahun banga hing tung ding tam ka thugente, na gintat lou ziehin, tam silte ahing tun masangsie’n hamtheilou leh thugen theilouin na um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh mipiten Zakaria ana ngah ua, Pasian biehinn sunga a um sawt seng ziehin lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahing pawtdoh tahin akung uah thu agenthei tasih a; tuachi’n biehinn sungah kilahna amu ahi chi atheita ua; aziehpen akung uah akhut in theisahnate abawl a, tualeh hamthei louin a umden ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anasepna ni abei tahin a inn langah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua nite nua in, azi Elizabeth ahing gaita a, ha nga sung akibuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mite lah a ka minsie sel dingin, “Mangpa’n ahing mu tahin tambangin ka tungah abawlta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aha guhna ah Pasian in vansawlsieng Gabriel Galili gam a khuo khat, amin Nazareth kichi ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nungah siengthou khat kungah asawl a, tua nungah khu David hahlesuon mi khat amin Joseph toh kikhamsa ahi ua, nungah siengthou min khu Mari ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh vansawlsieng khu a kungah alut a, akungah, “Nuomin nahpitaha deisahnu, Mangpa na kungah a um hi, numei lah ah hamphanu nahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh amanu’n ama amu tahin athugente ah alungbuoi a, tami bangchibang kinousietna ahitabep diei izaw, chiin akingaituo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng in akungah, “Mari zau sin Pasian deisahna na tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai in, nau na pai dinga, tapa na nei dinga, amin JESU na hisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama mi lien ahing hi dinga, Tungnungpen tapa akichi ding hi, tualeh Mangpa Pasian in, akungah, apa David Mangtoupha ape ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Jakob hahlesuonte tungah kumtawn in vai ahawm ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mari in vansawlsieng kungah, “Tami bang achi hi thei diei? Pasal lah nei nailou inga,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh vansawlsieng in adawnga akungah, “Hagau siengthou na tungah ahing tung dinga, Tungnungpen silbawltheina in ahing liekhu dinga, tuaziehin Mi siengthou hing pieng ding zong Pasian Tapa akichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai in, na sanggamnu Elizabethin zong ateh nua in tapa khat apaita hi, achiing achi nu uh tuin aha guhna ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian dingin ahitheilou bangma a um sih ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Mari in “Ngai in, Mangpa suohnu ka hi, na thu bangin ka tungah tung heh,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Vansawlsieng in anuasieta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khum hun lai in Mari akisadoh a, singtang gam a Juda khopi khat ah kintah in ahawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh Zakaria inn ah alut a, Elizabeth anousiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Elizabethin Mari nousietna azah tahin asunga naungeh khu akidieng hi, tualeh Elizabeth khu Hagau Siengthouin ahing dimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n aw ngaitah in akikoukhie a, “Numei lah ah hamphanu na hi, tualeh na gil a ga zong ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh ka Mangpa nu ka kunga na hing haw, bangchidan ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai vawi, na hing nousietna aw gin kabil a alut tahin, ka gil sunga naungeh nuom in akidieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh agingta nu zong ahampha hi, Mangpa’n akunga athugente tangtung ding ahizieh in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mari in, “Ka hinna in Mangpa apahtawi a,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />ka hagau zong ka hundampa, Pasian tungah anuom seng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman asuohnu ngiem dan athei a, Ngai in, tu akipat in khangtha zousie in, hampha ahing chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama mihat in ka tungah, sil thupitah ahing bawlpieh a, Amin zong Siengthou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama zaudan siemte tungah, ahepina akhang akhangin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Abantha in athahat dan a ensah a, mi kiliensahte lungtang ngaituona athethang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Aman mi hatte khu amangtoupha ua pat in akaikhie a, mi ngiemte atawisangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Aman gilkielte sil hoi in agilva sah a, tualeh mihausate khu khutguohin asawlmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ahepina theizingnain asuoh Israel apanpita hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />kumtawn a dinga ipu ipate, Abraham leh ahahasuonte kunga, ana chiemsa mabangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tualeh Mari akungah ha thum vel ataam a, tuachi’n a inn ah apei kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tualeh Elizabeth khu anau suoh hun ahingtungta a; tapa ahing neita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A innvengte leh asanggamten, Mangpa’n ahepina thupitah atungah asulangta chi azah tahun akipahpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tuachi’n a ni giet niin naungeh teptan dingin ahing pei ua, amin dingin apa min mama Zakaria hisah atum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tuabepin anu’n adawnga, “Tuabang hilou e, Johan hisah zawh ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tualeh amaun amanu kungah, “Na be na phung lah ah tami min puo koima umloupi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun apa kungah, amin bang na hisah nuom ei chiin theisahna abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n laigelna suonglai khat angen a, “Amin Johan ahi,” chi’n agielta hi. Tualeh amaun lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Thakhat in akam ahing kihongta a, alei ahing kiham a, ahing ham a, Pasian apahtawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuabepin akim ua, umte zousie azauta ua, tualeh tam thute Judia singtang gam zousie ah, athangsuoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tualeh azakha zousiein, alungtang uah a vom chiet ua, “Tam naungeh bangchibang ahing hi tabep diei izaw?” achi uhi. Tualeh Mangpa khutin ama a umpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tuachi’n apa Zakaria Hagau Siengthouin ahing dim a, thu agenta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Israel Mangpa, Pasian pahtawi in um heh, Aziehpen Aman amite ahing ve a, ahing tanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Tualeh asuoh David innkuonte lah ah hundamna kii ahing tungdoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Leitung pienchil apat aguolnei siengthoute kam a ana gensa mabangin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Igalte lah a kipat leh ahing mudate zousie khut akipat hundam in i um a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Ipu ipate kunga ana chiemsa khotuona tangtungsah ding leh athuhun siengthou thei ngitnget dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />ipu uh Abraham kunga kichiem a akihahsiel na khu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />I galte lah a kipat in ahing hunkhie a, zauloua Ana isep theina dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />I damsung nite a, Amasang a siengthou leh dihtattah a um dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Tualeh nang naungeh, Tungnungpen guolnei ahing kichi ding hi; aziehpen alampite bawl dingin Mangpa masangah na pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Akhelnate uh ngaidamna dinga, amite kunga hundamna theina pe dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />I Pasian uh khotuona nemtah zal in; tunglam a kipat nisuoh in ahing khawta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Miel lah leh shina lim nuoi a toute tanvah ding leh hamuonna lampi a i kengte hing puipieh ding in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Tuachi’n naungeh khu ahing khang lien a, hagau lam ah ahing hat deudeu a, Israelte kunga ahing kilah masangsie in gamdai ah a umta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun lai in Kaisar Augustus in leitung pumpi min khum ding thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam pen Siria gam a, Kuirinius gam uhpipa ahi lai a kisimpina masa pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi zousie amin uh khum dingin ama uh khopi chiet azuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Joseph zong David innkuon leh ahahasuonte ahi zieh in, Galili gam a Nazareth khuo akipat in Judia gam a David khopi Bethlehem kichi ah ahawta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mari azi kham gaiham toh, min khum dingin akuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n khuna a umlai un, anau nei ahing hunta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh a tapa masa pen ahing neikheta a, tualeh puonnemin atuom a, zintunna inn a, ama ua dinga mun a umlou ziehin gan annkuong sungah asiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh khum gam ma ah, belam chingte a um ua, zanlai in gamlah ah abelamte uh aveng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, Mangpa vansawlsieng khat akung uah ahing dinga, Mangpa thupina in akim uh atanvah a, tuachi’n azauta mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsiengin akung uah, “Zau sih unlen, Ngai un, michin a dingin thu hoi kipah huoi mama ka hing puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen tuni’n nou a dingin David khuo ah Hundampa apiengta hi, Ama Khrist Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh tami nou a dingin chiemtena ahi ding hi; naungeh puon a tuom, gan annpiehna kuonga lum na mu ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh thakhat in vansawlsieng kungah van mipite tampi ahing umkhawm ua, Pasian aphat uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tungnung pen ah Pasian thupi henlen, Leitunga akipahpi mihingte lah ah, lemthu leeng hen,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh vansawlsiengten van a apeisan tah un, belamputen, “Tuin Bethlehem khuo ah va pei vaiin Mangpa’n thu ahinghil hing tung khu iva en ding uhi” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n kinawtahin ahing peita ua, Mari leh Joseph toh gan annpiehna kuonga naungeh lum ava muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama ava mu tahun, tam naungeh tungtang thu ama uh kihil khu agenthangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh azakha poumain tua belampute thugen lamdang asa chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Mari in tam thute zousie alungtang ah avom a, angaituo ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n belampute khu, ama uh kihil bang ngei a sil zousie azah ua amu zieh un, Pasian pahtawi leh phat kawm in anua pei kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh ateptanna ding ni giet ahing chin tahin, tua naungeh khu amin dingin, naubu sunga a um masanga van sawlsiengin aphuosa Jesu aphuota uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi dan dungzui a, amanu kisiensuo ni ahing tun tahin Jerusalem ah ama ahing pui ua, Mangpa kunga ama lat dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mangpa dan dungzui a kigiel bangin, “Ta pasal naubu hong masa pouma Mangpa a dinga siengthou akichi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa dan thu a kigen dungzui in vakhu kopkhat ahiei, “Vapal nou ni ahiei, kithoina a lan ding in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, Jerusalem ah mi khat amin Simeon kichi a um a, tam mipa khu midihtat leh Pasian ngaina mi ahi a, Israelte hamuonna ding angah ngitnget a, Hagau Siengthou atung ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa Khrist amu masangsie ashi sih ding chi Hagau Siengthouin ana theisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hagau theisahna in Pasian biehinn ah alut a, tualeh naungeh Jesu khu anu leh apa’n ngaina dan dungzuia bawl dinga, ahing lutpi lai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aman ana angpom a, Pasian aphat a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Mangpa tuin na thu bang zel in, na suoh hamuong tahin na peisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen ka mitin na hundamna amuta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi zousie mit mu a na bawlsa khu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jentelte kunga hundamna vah tun ding leh, na mi Israelte thupina dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh naungeh tungtang thu agen khu anu leh apa’n lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Simeon in amauh aguolzawl a, anu Mari kungah; “Ngai in, tam naungeh Israel lah a, mi tampi puana ding leh tundingna dinga guot ahi. Tualeh gensietna chiemtena zong ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />(Ahi nangma lungtang zong namsau in adawt pailet ding a) tuachi a mi tampi lungtang ngaituona akilat theina dingin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Asher nam a mi, Phanuel tanu, Anna kichi numei guolnei khat a um a, amanu tesetah ahita a, anungah tawp nuasie apasal kungah kum sagi a um a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh tam numeinu khu meithai kum sawmgiet leh kum li vel mi ahi a, amanu’n Pasian bieh inn peisan louin sun leh zan in ann ngawlna toh thungen in Pasian abie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin amanu ahing pei a, Pasian kungah kipah thu agen a, Jerusalem khuo a tatna ding lamen zousie kungah, Jesu tanchin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa dan dungzui a sil zousie abawl zou un, Galili gam a amauh khuo Nazareth ah anua pei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh naungeh ahing khanglien deudeu a, alungsim ahing hat hiei hiei a, pilnain ahing dimta hi, tualeh Pasian khotuona atungah aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n pei Kaan pawi mangin anu leh apa Jerusalem ah kum chinin ahaw zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu kum sawm leh ni ahing hi in, pawi ngaina dan dungzuiin Jerusalem ah ava haw tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Apawi man uh ahing kiven bep a ahing kinuale laiun naupang Jesu khu Jerusalem ah a um denta a, tualeh Joseph leh anuin athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun alawite lah ua um hiva achi ua, ni khat lam apeita uhi; tuachi’n ahieng asante ulah leh ameltheite ulah asui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachia amu lou tah un, ama sui kawm in Jerusalem ah akinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh ni thum nua in, Pasian biehinn ah Siete lah a, athu uh ngaikhie leh ama uh thu dongin ava muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh Ama thu za pouma in atheisiemdan leh adawndante lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Anu leh apa’n ava mu tahun lamdang asa mama ua, anu’n akungah, “Bawi bangdinga tambanga nang bawl ahiei? Ngai in, na pa leh ken lunggim tahin ka hing sui uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n akung uah, “Bangdinga hing sui na hi uoi mah? Ka Pa inn a um a ana ka sep ding mawng ahi chi theilou na hi uoi mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun akung ua athugen atheisiem sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama uh azui suh a, Nazareth khuo ahing tung ua, athu uh mangin a um hi. Tualeh anuin tam silte zousie alungtangah avom ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu khu pilna lam leh tahsa ah ahing khanglien deudeu a, Pasian leh mihing deisah in a um deudeuta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tiberia Kaisar vaihawm kum sawm leh kum nga kum in, Pontius Pilat, Judia gam uhpipa ahi a, tualeh Herod khu Galili gam a kumpipa ahi a, asanggampa Philip khu Ituria leh Trokoniti kumpipa ahi a, tualeh Lisanias khu Abilene gam kumpipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Annas leh Kaiapha khu siempu lienpente ahi ua, khum hun laiin gamdai ah Zakaria tapa Johan kungah Pasian thu ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ama khu Jordan lui kimvel a gam zousie ah khelnate ngaidamna dinga kisiana baptisma thugen in apei kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Guolnei Isai laibu a, “Gamdai a mikikou aw in, Mangpa lamlien siel unlen, alampite sutang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Guom chin suhdim ahi dinga, muol leh tang chin suhngiem ahi dinga, tualeh akawina munte suh tang ahi dinga, aphawhnate suhmam ahi dinga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh mi zousie in Pasian hundamna amu ding uh,” chia kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akunga baptisma tang dinga hing pei mipite kungah, “Nou gul suonte aw, lungthahna hing tung ding taisan dinga, hing vauhil koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin kisiana tham chingin ga suong un, tualeh Abraham ka pu uh ahi chiin na lungsim un ngaituo sih un, aziehpen Pasian in tam suongte Abraham hahlesuonte in ading sah thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu mamain zong sing zung chin ah heipi koi ahita, tuaziehin sing chin ga hoi a galou pouma phuain a um a, meikuong lai a pai in a um zel hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipiten akungah, “Ahileh Kouten bang ka bawl ding uoi leh?” chiin adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman adawnga, akung uah, “Koipou puon ah ni neiin, aneilou hawm heh, tualeh koipou ann neiin tuamabangin bawl heh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n siedongmite zong baptisma tang dingin ahing pei ua, akung ah, “Siepa kouten bang ka bawl ding uoi?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah, “Ahing bihieh sah val uh khon nawn sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuamabangin galkapten zong akungah, “Kouten bang ka bawl ding uoi?” chiin adong uhi. Aman akung uah “Koima pawngbawlin sum lahpieh sih unlen, dihlou tahin koima heh sih unlen, na law uah lungkim un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite kinemtahin a um ua, mi zousiein Johan khu Khrist ahi kha de aw, chia alungtang ua angaituo lai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Johan in adawnga, akung uah, “Ken tuiin ka hing baptis a, hinanleh Kei sanga thupi zaw khat ahing pei dinga, Kei pen akedap khau sut taah zong ka hi hisih hi. Aman Hagau Siengthou leh meiin nou ahing baptis ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman akhut in phazap atawi a, aphuol azap sieng kilkel dinga, tualeh bute abupangah asungkhawm ding hi, hinanleh bushite pen mei mit theilou toh ahaltum ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh hanthawnna thu dang tampi toh mipite kungah khantan hoi thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh kumpipa Herod in asanggampa Philip zi Herodia zieh leh asilgilou bawl zousie tung thu a Johan in aphawhhil ziehin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asil bawlkhel zousie belapnain Johan suongkul ah akhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh mipi zousie in baptisma atan zou tah un, Jesu’n zong baptisma atanga, thungetna anei laiin van ahing kihonga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Hagau Siengthou tahsa puoin vakhu bangin ahing kumsuh a, “Atungah atuta a, tualeh van a kipat in aw ahing pawt a, Nang ka Tapa deitah na hi, na tungah ka lungdam mama hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n nasep apat chiil lai in kum sawmthum vel ahita a, mite ngaidanin Joseph tapa ahia, tua khu Heli tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Heli khu Matthat tapa ahia, Matthat khu Levi tapa ahia, Levi khu Melki tapa ahia, Melki khu Janna tapa ahia, Janna khu Joseph tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Joseph khu Matathiah tapa ahia, Matathiah khu Amos tapa ahia, Amos khu Nahum tapa ahia, Nahum khu Esli tapa ahia, Esli khu Naggai tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Naggai khu Maath tapa ahia, Maath khu Mattathiah tapa ahia, Matathiah khu Semei tapa ahia, Semei khu Joseph tapa ahia, Joseph khu Juda tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Juda khu Joannas tapa ahia, Joannas khu Rhesa tapa ahia, Rhesa khu Zerubbabel tapa ahia, Jerubbabel khu Shealtiel tapa ahia, Shealtiel khu Neri tapa ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Neri khu Melki tapa ahia, Melki khu Addi tapa ahia, Addi khu Kosam tapa ahia, Kosam khu Elmodam tapa ahia, Elmodam khu Er tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Er khu Joshua tapa ahia, Joshua khu Eliezer tapa ahia, Eliezer khu Jorim tapa ahia, Jorim khu Matthat tapa ahia, Matthat khu Levi tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Levi khu Simeon tapa ahia, Simeon khu Juda tapa ahia, Juda khu Joseph tapa ahia, Joseph khu Jonan tapa ahia, Jonan khu Eliakim tapa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Eliakim khu Melia tapa ahia, Melia khu Menan tapa ahia, Menan khu Mattathah tapa ahia, Mattathah khu Nathan tapa ahia, Nathan khu David tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David khu Jesse tapa ahia, Jesse khu Obed tapa ahia, Obed khu Boaz tapa ahi, Boaz khu Salmon tapa ahia, Salmon khu Nahshon tapa ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nahshon khu Aminadab tapa ahia, Aminadab khu Aram tapa ahia, Aram khu Hezron tapa ahia, Hezron khu Perez tapa ahia, Perez khu Juda tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Juda khu Jakob tapa ahia, Jakob khu Isaak tapa ahia, Isaak khu Abraham tapa ahia, Abraham khu Terah tapa ahia, Terah khu Nahor tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nahor khu Serug tapa ahia, Serug khu Reu tapa ahia, Reu khu Peleg tapa ahia, Peleg khu Heber tapa ahia, Heber khu Shelah tapa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Shelah khu Kainan tapa ahia, Kainan khu Arpaksad tapa ahia, Arpaksad khu Shem tapa ahia, Shem khu Noah tapa ahia Noah khu Lamek tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lamek khu Mathuselah tapa ahia, Mathuselah khu Enok tapa ahia, Enok khu Jared tapa ahia, Jared khu Mahalalel tapa ahia, Mahalalel khu Kainan tapa ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kainan khu Enos tapa ahia, Enos khu Seth tapa ahia, Seth khu Adam tapa ahia, Adam khu Pasian tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu khu Hagau Siengthoua dim in Jordan lui a kipat in akinuale kia a, tualeh gamdai ah Hagau puiin aum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni sawmli sung diabol sol in a umta a; tua nite sungin Aman bangma ane sih a, tuachi’n atawpin agil ahing kielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n diabol in akungah “Pasian Tapa na hileh tam suong tanghou suoh dingin thupie in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n adawnga “Mihing tanghou guohin ahing sih dinga, Pasian thu chin in ahing zaw ding chi gel ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n diabol in Ama khu muol sang tung khat ah apuitou a, mitphiet kallouin leitung leenggam zousie a ensahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n diabol in akungah, “Tamte zousie tunga thuneina leh athupina ka hing pe ding, ka kunga piehkhiet ahitah ziehin, ka pieh ut tapou kungah ka pe zel hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin kei na hing bieh pouleh abawnin nanga ahi ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n adawnga akungah, “Setan ka nualangah um in; Mangpa na Pasian na be dinga Ama nna bou na sep ding ahi, chi gel ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n diabol in Ama khu Jerusalem ah apui a, “Pasian biehinn sipvum ah akoi a, akungah, Pasian Tapa na hileh tana kipat in kesuh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman nang hing humbit dingin, avansawlsiengte thu ape dinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaun akhut un ahing dom ding ua, tua ahisihleh na kengin suong asui kha ding hi, chiin akigiel hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n adawnga, akungah, “Mangpa na Pasian ze et sin,” akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n diabol in asolna ding tenga asol zouin hun lemtang a dingin apeisanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu khu Hagau silbawltheinain Galili gam ah akinuale kiata a, tualeh atanchin khu khum gam kimvel ah athang suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh akikhopna innte uah, thu ahil zel a mi zousie pahtat in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n akhanletna khuo Nazareth ahing tungta hi. Tualeh abawldan ngaina bangin khawlni in kikhopna innah aluta, Laisiengthou sim dingin ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh akungah guolnei Isai laibu apie ua, tuachi’n Aman tua laibu aphen a tam thu kigelna mun laitah aphendoh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mi liengvaite kunga khantan hoi, gen dinga sathau ahing nutah ziehin, Mangpa Hagau ka tungah a um hi, Aman lungtang hasete sudam ding leh, saltangte kunga suotatna thu leh, mittote kunga mitvah kiana thu gen ding leh, bawlsietna thuohte zalenna leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa lungdam kum thu gen dingin ahing sawl hi,” chi khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n laibu khu aziel a, thu nasempa apekia a, atouta hi. Tualeh kikhopna inn a um mi zousie mit atungah atuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Tuni’n tam Laisiengthou thu na zah un atangtung ta hi,” chiin agen panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi zousiein athu atheipi ua, tualeh akama pawt hepina thute lamdang asa mama uhi. Tualeh amaun “Tampa khu Joseph tapa hilou amah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Nouten tam paunah Daktor nang leh nang kisudam in, Kapernaum khuo a na silbawlte ka na zah zousie uh tanah, nangma kholam ah zong bawl in na hing chi ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, guolnei koima ama gam sung ah akipahpi ngai sih u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh thudih ka hing hil ahi, Elijah damlai a kum thum leh ha guh van akikha a, leitunga kiel nasatah atun laiin Meithai tampi a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh Sidon gam a Zarephath khuo a meithainu khat kungah chilou alah ua koima kungah Elijah sawl ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh guolnei Elisha damlai in, Israel gam ah phah tampi a um uh, hinanleh Siria mi Naaman chilou koima suhsiengthou in a um sih hi achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n kikhopna inn a um zousie in tam thute azah tah un alungthah chietta ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh adingdoh ua, khopi akipat a deldoh ua, akhuo uh umna muolvuma kawlkhoua sawnkhieh dingin apuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh ama khu akikaal uah apeisuoh a, apei mangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Galili gam a khuo khat Kapernaum ah ahing peisuh a, tualeh khawlnite in amauh thu ahil a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh thuneitah a thu agen ziehin athuhil khu lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh kikhopna inn ah hagau bua nei mi khat a um a, tualeh aw ngaitahin akikou a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Kouma tangin hing um sahin, Nazareth Jesu nang leh kouten bang ahiei kizopna inei? Koute sumang ding a hing pei na hiei mah? Nang koi na hiei chi ka hing thei hi, Pasian Mi Siengthou na hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n aphawh a, “Sip inlen asunga pat in hing pawtdoh in achi hi. Tualeh dawi in amapa alah ua asawnpua zouin ahing pawtdoh a, bangma alaw nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh abawn un lamdang asa mama ua, Tami bang thu atai le! Thuneitah leh silbawltheitahin dawibuate thu apie a, apawt mai uhi,” chiin akihou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua kim gam mun chin ah atanchin athangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Ama adingdoh a, kikhopna inn apat apawt a, Simon inn ah alutta hi. Tualeh Simon zinu nu khu napitahin ana khosih a, tuachi’n Ama khu amanu a dingin ana nget pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama khu amanu geiah a dinga, khosih khu aphawh a, tuachi’n aphata hi, tualeh ahing thou pai a ana uh asep piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh nitumkuon ahing hi tahin, natna tuomtuom a na, damlou nei zousie in akungah ahing pui ua; tualeh Aman ama uh tung chiet ah khut angama asudamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh dawite zong “Nang Khrist Pasian Tapa na hi chia kikou in,” mi tampite sunga kipat in ahing pawtdoh uhi. Tualeh Aman amauh aphawh a, aham ding uh aphal sih hi, amaun Khrist ahi chi athei zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh khuo ahing vah bepin, apawtdoh a koima umlouna mun sip ah a peita hi. Tualeh mipiten Ama asui ua, akungah ahing pei ua, amauh nuasie lou dingin tuhtaang atum uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman akung uah, “Pasian leenggam tanchin khodanga zong ka gen ding ahi, tua ding mawnga sawl ka hi zieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n Galili gam a kikhopna innte ah thu agen zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Pasian thu ngai dinga mipiten Ama a bawbuoi lai un, Genesaret dil gei ah Ama adinga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh dil gei a kuong ni um amu a, hinanleh nga manmiten akuong uh nuasie a, alente uh sawp in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n kuongte lah a khat, Simon a pen ah atuonga, akungah pieugei apat themkhat tawldeu ding in angen a, tualeh atou a, kuong tung apat in mipite kungah thu ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh thu gen atawp bep in, Simon kungah, “Li thuh lam nai unlen, nga man dingin na lente uh sep un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Simon in adawnga, akungah, “Siepa aw, zan khovah in gimtahin ka pang ua, bangma ka man sih uhi, ahivangin na thuin len ka sep ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh len ase u’leh nga tampi akhukha ua, tualeh alente uh keh dingin akisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n kuong danga um alawmte uh ama uh hing panpi dingin akhutzap ua, tuachi’n amauh ahing pei ua, kuong nite gel ah asung dim ua, tuachi’n tum dingin akisa phielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Simon Peter in tami amu in, Jesu khup kunga khupboh in, “Mangpa Aw hing peisan in, mikhiel ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nga mat uh ama leh alawmten lamdang asah mama zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Simon kithuopite Zebedi tapate Jakob leh Johan in zong lamdang asa uhi. Tualeh Jesu’n Simon kungah, “Zau sin, Tu bansie mihing na manta ding achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n akuongte uh luipangah ahing tawldoh ua, bangma zousie nuasie in Ama azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, khuo khat a a um laiin, Ngai in, mi khat apumtanga phah tuom aum a, aman Jesu amu tahin tuol ah akhupboh a, “Mangpa na ut leh Kei nang susieng thei hi, chiin angen ngenngut hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akhut in asawh a, akhoi a, “Ka ut hi, siengthoutain,” achi hi. Tuachi’n thakhat in aphahnain anuasie paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akungah, Koima hil sinlen, hinanleh “Va pei inlen, siempu kungah va ki ensah inlen na sienthouna dingin Mosi thupieh bangin sil va lan in, amaute theisahna dingin,” chiin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu tanchin athang nasa zawsemsem a, mipi tampi athu za nuom leh anatna uh kisudamsah nuomin ahing peikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama gamdai ah atuom pei a, athumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh ni khat hichi ahing hi a, Jesu’n thu ahil laitahin, Galili leh Judia gam kho chin akipan leh Jerusalem khuo akipat a hing pei Pharisaite leh dan siemte akung ah atou ua, tualeh amauh suhdamna dingin, Mangpa silbawltheina khu akungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ngai vawi, miten zeng khat lupna in ahing zawng ua, Amasang a zawnlut atum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh mipi ziehin azawnlutna dan amu thei sih ua, inn tungah akaltou ua, tualeh bichiing aphetvang ua, inn tung akipat alaikim tah a Jesu mai ah alupnatoh akhaikhe suh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n aginna uh amuin akungah, “Mihing na khelnate ngaidam ahita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n laigielmite leh Pharisaiten Pasian gensie “Tam mipa koi ahiei? Pasian chilou ngal koi ahiei khelna ngaidam thei?” chiin angaituo panta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n angaituonate uh athei tahin, adawng a, akung uah, “Bang dinga na lungsim ua kidongtuo na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na khelnate ngaidam ahita chi leh, thou inlen na kengin peita in chi heipen abailam zaw ei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Mihing Tapa in leitungah khel ngaidam theina anei hi chi na theina ding un,” zeng a damloupa kungah, “Thou inlen, na lupna la inlen na innah peita in, ka hing chi ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n amasang uah athou pai a, alupna ala a a inn langah Pasian phat kawmin apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n abawn un lamdang asa mama ua, Pasian aphat ua, “Tuni’n sil lamdang tah imu uhi,” achi ua, azau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam silte zouin apawtkhie a, sie piehna mun a tou, amin Levi kichi siedongmi khat amu a; tualeh akungah “Hing zuiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman bangkim nuasie in, adingdoh a, Ama azuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levi in a inn ah Jesu dingin annkuong thupitah a lui a, khunah siedongmite tampi leh midangten amauh annkuong a impi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh alaigielmite u’leh Pharisaite khu anuazuite tungah aphun ua, “Bangdinga siedongmite leh mikhielte toh ne a dawn khawm nahi uoi?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n adawng a, akung uah, “Mi chidamten Doktor atulmaw sih ua, mi damlouten atulmaw zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Midihtatte han dinga hing pei ka hi sih a, hinanleh mikhielte han a kisiasah dinga hing pei ka hi zaw hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Johan nuazuiten ann angawl zel ua, tualeh thu angen zel uhi, tuamabangin Pharisaite nuazuiten zong abawl uhi; hinanleh Nang nuazuiten bangdinga ne a dawn ahi uoi?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Moupuite kunga mouneipa a um laisie moupuite ann na ngawlsah thei uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanleh alah uapat mouneipa lahmang nite ahing tung dinga, tua ni chiengin ann angawl ding uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n akung uah gente thu khat zong agen a, “Koima’n puon thain puon lui aphaw ngai sih, phawta leh atha pen in alui khu kaikeh dinga, tualeh atha thempen alui toh akituoh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Koima’n uoin tha khu savun thawl lui ah akoi ngai sih, koitaleh uoin thain savun thawl lui khu apawhkehsah dinga, akibo dinga, tualeh savun thawlte zong ase ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh uoin tha khu savun thawl tha a koi ding ahi, tuachi’n ani in abit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mi koiman uoin lui adawn zouin, uoin tha alunggul pai ngai sih ua, alui ma tuizaw achi zel uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Khawlni masapen zou a khawlni nina pen niin buleilaite ah apeisuoh ua, anuazuiten buvuite asihtan ua, akhut ua nuoiin ane uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Pharisai koite ahiei in akungah, “Bangdinga khawlni a bawl sienglou na bawl uh ahiei” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu’n adawng a, akung uah, “David leh alawmten agilkiel lai ua, asilbawl uh simkha lou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachia Pasian inn a alut a, siempute loungal neh sienglou tanghou alah a, aneh a, tualeh alawmte kunga zong apieh thu,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah “Mihing Tapa khu khawlni Mangpa zong ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawlni dangin, kikhopna inn ah alut a, thu ahila, tualeh khunah mi khat akhut zietlam zaw ana um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh laigielmite leh Pharisaiten, ahehsietna ding amu theina dingun, khawlni a asuhdam leh suhdamlou asim et uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman angaituote uh atheia, khut zawpa kungah, “Thou inlen tanah hing dingin,” achi a, tualeh ama athou a adingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akung uah, “Sil khat ka hing dong ding hi, Khawlni a sil hoi bawl asieng ei, ahisihleh sil gilou bawl? Hinna hundam ahiei sieng ahisihleh suhlup?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh akima umte a enkuol a, “Tua mipa kung ah na khut jahin” achi a, tuachi’n aman azah a, tuachi’n alangkhat bangbangin adamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh amauh alungthah mama ua, Jesu tunga abawldan ding uh khat leh khat akikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hun laiin apawtkhie a, muol ah thungen dingin apei a, tualeh zankhovah in Pasian kungah athum den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh sun ahing hi bepin, anuazuite akungah ahan a, alah ua kipat sawm leh ni ateldoh a, amin u’zong sawltahte achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Simon, Aman Peter achipa leh asanggampa Andru, Jakob leh Johan; Philip leh Bartholomai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mathiu leh Thomas, Alpheus tapa Jakob leh Zealot kichipa Simon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakob tapa Juda leh amansahpa Juda Iskariot, ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh amautoh apei suh a, mun jang tung khat ah ading a, anuazuite mipi tampi leh Judia gam pumpi leh Jerusalem akipat leh Tai-ar leh Sidon kholam a, tuipi gei akipat mipi thupitah athu ngai nuom leh adamlounate uh suhdam ut in ahing pei ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dawibua in asuhgenthei mite zong ahing pei uhi. Tualeh amaute zong suhdam in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Ama akipat a silbawltheina apawtkhie a, amauh zousie adamsah ziehin, abawn un Ama thamkhah atum chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama adahtou a, anuazuite a en a, “Nou gentheite aw na hampha uhi, Pasian gam noute a ahiziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nou tu a gilkielte na hampha uhi, gilva ding na hi zieh un; “Nou tu a kapte na hampha uhi, nui ding na hi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa zieh a miten ahing muda ua, ahing nawdoh ua, ahing housiet ua, na min uh ahoi sih chia ahing pampai chiengun na hampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin kipah unlen, nuomin kitawm un, Ngai un, van ah na nuomman uh athupi ahi. Aziehpen tuamabangin apu leh pate un guolneite ana bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hinanleh nou mihausate na tunguh agih hi, aziehpen nouten na hamuon na uh na mu zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nou tu a gilvate na tung uh agih hi, aziehpen gilkiel ding na hi uhi. Nou tu a nuite na tunguh agih hi aziehpen Kap a mau ding na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mi zousie in ahing phat chieng un na tung uh agih hi, Aziehpen apu lepate un, tuamabangin, guolnei tahloute tungah ana bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hinanleh nou ka thu ngaikhete kungah kang hil ahi, na galte uh it unlen, ahing mudate tungah silhoi bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nou hing hamsiette guolzawl unlen, ahing simmawte thum pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na pheta hing behpiehte kungah alangkhat lam zong dawin, tualeh na puonzal hing lahpiehpa kungah na puonah zong it sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na kunga hing ngen pouma pie inlen, tualeh na neitah hing lahpiehpa kungah ngenkia nawn sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh miten na tung ua abawl dinga na dei banguh mi tungah zong bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Hinanleh nou hing itte maimai na it u’leh pahtat bang na law ding uoi, Mikhielten zong amauh itte a it sam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh na tung ua silhoi bawlte tung maimai a, silhoi na bawl uleh pahtat bang nalaw ding uoi? Mikhielten zong tuabangin abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh mukia na kinepnate kung maimai a na palahsah u’leh bang pahtat na law ding uoi? Mikhielten zong apalahsah za mu kia dingin mikhielte kungah apalahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanleh na melmate uh it unlen, bangma mu kia ding kinem louin palasah un, tuahileh na nuomman uh athupi dinga; Tungnungpen tate na hi ding uhi. Aziehpen Aman kipahna dan theiloute leh migiloute ahepi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuazieh in na Pa uh mi hepi asiem bangin noute zong mi hepi siem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Thukhen sih un, tuachi’n thukhenpieh in na um sih ding uhi, mawpai sih un, tuachi’n mawpai in na um sih ding uhi, tualeh ngaidam un tuachi’n ngaidam in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pia un, tuachi’n pieh in na um ding uh, hoitaha tein, namdet inlen, loh thopin, tuachi’n adimlet in na angsung uah pieh in na um ding uhi. Aziehpen na tena mama un ahing kitepieh ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah gentena khat agen a, “Mitto in mitto ma apui thei diei? Ani un guomkuoh ah kekhawm talou ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nuazui khu apu tungah aum sih a, hinanleh michin bukimtah a azil siem chieng un apu bangin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh bangdinga nangma mit a singtun um lam theilou a, na unaupa mit a ninneng neunou um na mu ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nangma mit a singtun um mu loupi a, na unaupa kunga, unaupa na mit a ninneng neunou um hing lakhesahin bangchi a chi thei na hiei? Milepchie nangma mit apat singtun lakhe masa in tuachi’n na unaupa mit a ninneng lahkhiet ding khu chientahin na mu thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Sing hoi gasie a ga a um ngai sih, sing sie lah ga hoia ga a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Singchin amauh ga chiet ah akithei hi. Mi’n lingkung ah theipi alou ngai sih ua, tualeh lingnoh lah ah grep alou ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mi hoi in alungtang goubawm hoi akipat in sil hoi ahing pawtkhe sah zel a, tualeh migilou in alungtang goubawm sie a kipat in sil hoilou ahing pawtkhe sah zel hi, aziehpen lungtanga dimval kam in agenkhe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh nouten “Bangdinga ka gente bawl loupi a Mangpa Mangpa hing chi na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi koipou ka kunga hing pei a, ka thugente za-a, zui khu, koi bangte ahi uoi ka hing ensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ama khu inn lam mi thuh tah a tou a, suongpi tunga suongphum lem mi bang ahi; tualeh tui ahing let a, tuikhauin tua inn ahing kho a, asuling zou sih hi, suongpi tunga lam ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hinanleh za ngal a zuilou khu suongphum dettah a lem loua leitunga inn lam mi bang ahi; tua inn khu tui khau in ahing kho a apua pai hi; tua inn siet khu anasa mama hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu’n mite zah a athugen zousie azaw nuain Kapernaum khuo ah alut a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh galkap zahoutu koi ahiei khat asuohpa deitah china in ashi dihdih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu tanchin azah tahin, asuohpa hing sudam dinga ngen dingin Juda upate akungah asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh amauh Jesu kung avatun un, “Tam sil ama a dinga na bawlpieh taah ahi chiin angen uhi”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen aman ka nam uh a it a, ka kikhopna inn u’zong ama hing lampieh ahi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu amautoh ahing peita hi. Tualeh inn akipat gamlalou ahing tun un galkap zahoutupa’n alawmte asawl a akungah, “Mangpa kisugim nuomda mai in, aziehpen ka innsung na lutna taah ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin kei zong na kunga hing haw taahin ka kisim sih hi. Hinanleh athuin gen poulachin ka suohpa adam mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Kei zong mi thunuoi a um ka hi a, ka nuoi ah galkapte a um ua, khat kungah peiin, ka chi leh apei a, tualeh adang khat kungah, hing peiin, ka chi leh ahing pei hi; tualeh ka suohpa kungah tami bawlin, ka chi leh abawl hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu’n tam thute azah in, amapa khu lamdang asa mama a, akihei kuol a, mipi ama zuite kungah “Ka hing hil ahi, Israelte lah ah zong hichi va-ia a ginna thupi ka mu kha mawngmawng sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh ami sawlte inn langah anua pei kia ua, suoh damloupa khu, dam in amuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n hun sawt lou nua in, Nain kichi khuo khat ah ahaw a, tualeh anuazuite tampi leh mipi tamtah in Ama azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh khopi kotpi kung ahing tunin, Ngai vawi, mishi khat ahing zawngkhie ua, anu tapa neisun ahi a, amanu meithai ahi a, tua khuo a mipi tampi akungah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa’n meithainu a mutahin ahepita mama a, “Kap sin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n ava pei a, kuong kihongsa khu ava tham a, tualeh azawngte adingta uhi; tuachi’n “Aman tangval thou in, ka hing chi ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh mishi khu ahing toudoh a, ahing hamta hi, tuachi’n Jesu’n amapa khu anu kungah apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi zousie azauta ua, Pasian aphat ua, “I lah uoh guolnei thupitah ahing umta,” tualeh “Pasian in amite ahing veta hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Ama tungtang thu khu Judia gamsung pumpi leh akimvel gamte ah athang suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Johan nuazuiten tam thu zousie Johan kungah ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Johan in anuazuite lah a mi ni ahan a, Jesu kunga “Ahing pei dingpa na hiei mah? ahisihleh midang hungai nalai ding ka hi uoi mah?” chi ding in asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi nitegel akung ahing tun tahun, akungah “Baptispa Johan in, Ahing pei dingpa na hiei mah? ahisihleh midang hungai nalai ding ka hi uoi mah? chi a na kunga ahing sawlte ka hi uhi,” ava chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun lai tahin chinate hipi veite, dawi matte tampi asudam a, tualeh mitto tampite zong amit uh avah sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga akung uah, “Peita unlen na sil mute u’leh na zahte uh Johan vahil un; mittote mit ahing vahta a, Kengbaite kengin ahing peita ua, phate ahing siengthouta ua, bilbingten ahing za theita, mishite kaithawin a umta ua, tualeh mi gentheite kungah khantan hoi genin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh koipou ka tunga lungkimlouna muloute ahampha uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Johan mi sawlte apei nua un, Jesu’n mipite kungah, “Johan tungtang thu agen panta a, Bang en ding a gamdai a peidoh na hi uoi? pumpeng hui sem kinuh en dingin maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahisihleh bang en ding pen a peidoh na hi uoi? Puonnem silmi maw? Ngai un puon thupi sil leh mi nuomsate pen leengte innpi ah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahileh bang pen en dinga peidoh na hi uoi? guolnei maw? Ahi na kung uah ka gen ahi, Guolnei sanga thupi zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />En un, ka sawltah na masang ah ka sawl a, aman na masang ah na lampi asiel ding chia atanchin kigiel khu ama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Numei sunga pieng lah ah, Baptispa Johan sanga thupi zaw guolnei a um sih hi, hinanleh Pasian gama neupen zong ama sangin athupi zaw hi, chi ka hing hil ahi.” Achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh athu za zousie leh siedong mite zong Johan baptisma tangin, Pasian siem atan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh Pharisaite leh dansiem miten akunga baptisma tanglouin, Pasian in ama ua dinga aguotsa khu anuolta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Mangpa’n tulai khangthate bang toh ka gente ta diei? Tualeh bang chibang ahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amaute khu naupang vanzuona mun a tou a, khat leh khat, Theile hing tumpieh ung a, na lam sih ua, ka hing dapi u’leh lah na kap tuom sih ua, kichituate bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aziehpen Baptispa Johan ahing pei a, tanghou ane sih a, uoin zong adawn sih hi, noute’n Dawi pai ahi na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mihing Tapa ahing pei a, ane in adawn a, nouten En vawi uo, ann haipa, uoin haipa, siedongmite leh mikhielte lawmpa na chi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanleh pilna khu atate zousie in siem atan chiet uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pharisaite lah a khat in, Ama ann neh khawmpi dingin achiel a, tuachi’n Ama Pharisaipa inn ah alut a, annkuong ah atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, tuami khuo a um khelnanei numei khat in Jesu Pharisaipa inn ah ann ne in atou chi atheitahin alabastar bawm in thau namtui ahing tawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Anualang ah akengbul ah kap kawmin adinga akephangte ahitui in asawp pieh a, asam in asia a, akephang atawp a, thau namtui anu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama ann ne dinga chielpa Pharisai in tami amu tahin alungsimin “Tam mipa guolnei ahileh akhoinu koi ahiei, tualeh mi bangchibang ahiei, chi thei leh kilawm a, amanu lah mikhiel ahi ngal a,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n adawnga, akungah, “Simon na kungah thu gen ding khat ka nei hi,” achi hi; tuachi’n aman “Siepa gen in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Sum leitawisah mi koi ahiei in, sum leitawi mi ni anei hi. Khatin makhai za nga aba a, tualeh khat in sawmnga aba hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh asanna ding aneilou tah un, ani un angaidam tuohta hi. Tuazieh in hing hil in, tua mite gel koi zohin amapa a it zaw ding uoi?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Simon in adawnga, “Angaidam tam zoh pen pain hi dingin ka ngaituo hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Aman akungah “Na gen dih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei lam anga a, Simon kungah, “Tam numei na mu ei? Na inn ah ka hing lut a, ka kephang silna ding tui na hing pe sih a, hinanleh amanu’n ahituiin ka kephang asil a, asam in asia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nang tawp zong na hing tawpsih a, hinanleh tam numeinu’n ka hing lut akipat in ka kephang tawp akhawl nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nang ka lu sathau na hing nu sih a, hinanleh tam numei in ka kephang thau namtui ahing nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka hing hil ahi, akhelna tampite ngaidam ahita, amanu’n nahpitaha ahing it zieh in, hinanleh ngaidam tawmten a it tawm uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman numeinu kungah “Na khelnate ngaidam ahita,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tualeh ama toh annkuong a impiten “Mikhielte nangawn ngaidam thei, tam koi ahiei?” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman numeinu kungah, “Na ginnain ahing hundamta hi, hamuong tah in pei ta’n” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuami nua in, Jesu khu thuhil kawm leh Pasian gam khantan hoi gen kawmin kho lien leh kho neute ah avah kawikawi a, tualeh sawm leh nite akungah a um ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh numei koite ahiei, dawi mat dam kia leh, natnate apata dam kiate leh Mari Magdalene achi uh asung apata dawi sagi pawtdohnanu zong a um uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Herod sumkempa Chuza zi Joanna leh Susanna toh, tualeh midang tampite toh ahi ua, tuaten amauh neisa in, Ama apanpi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh mipi tampi ahing peikhawm ua, khochin a mi akunga ahing pei tah un, gentenain thu agen a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Buchithepa khat abuchithe dingin akuon a, tualeh athe laiin, kimkhat lampi gei ah akie a, tua khu akituonchil a, tungleeng vaten anegam siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh kimkhatte suong tungah akie a, tualeh ahing pou tahin, alei anom lou ziehin avuoi pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh kimkhatte loulingnei lah ah akie a, loulingnei toh ahing pou khawm a, adep mangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh kimkhatte lei hoi ah a kie a, ahing pou a ale za in agata hi,” achi hi. Tualeh tam thute agen zou in akikou a, “Koipou zahna ding bil nei in za uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n anuazuiten tam gentena thu bang china ahiei? chi’n Ama adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Aman “Pasian gam thuguhte noute thei dinga pieh ahia, midangte kungah pen gentena thu a gen ahi; mu napi a amu louna ding u’leh, za napia atheisiem louna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua gentena thu khu tami ahi: Buchi khu Pasian thu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh lampi gei a kete khu thu zakhate ahi ua, tuachi’n diabol ahing pei a agintat lou ua, hundam ahi thei louna ding un, alungtang ua kipat thu khu alah mangpieh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh suong tunga kete ahileh azah tah ua thu kipah tah a pom paite ahi ua, hinanleh tamten bulbal anei sih ua, bakhat sung agingta ua, solna atuoh chieng un apua pai zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh loulingnei lah a kete ahileh, thu azah nua un apei ua, khosah dingdan ngaituonate, hausatnate leh damsung nopsahnate’n adep a, aga piching ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh lei hoia kete pen, thu khu za a, lungtang hoitah leh za um tah a pomdet thuohhatna toh ga suongte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mi koima’n thaumei adet chiengun law akhu ngai sih, ahisihleh lupna nuoi ah akoi ngai sih hi, hinanleh alut pouma in amu theina dingun atunna ah akoi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Akiphuonglou dinga im bangma a um sih a, tualeh theilou ding leh langlou dinga phuolguh bangma a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin bangchibanga na zah uh ahiei, pilvangun; aziehpen koipou anei khu pieh belap ahi dinga, tualeh koipou aneilou khu nei a akingaisut nasan zong lahpieh ahi ding achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh anu leh asanggamte Jesu kungah ahing pei ua, hinanleh mipi ziehin akung ahing tung thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh “Na nu leh na sanggamte nang hing mu nuom in inn pulang ah ading uhi,” chi’n ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman adawnga akung uah, “Ka nu leh ka sanggamte khu tam Pasian thu ngai a, zuite ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hia, ni khat anuazuite toh kuong ah atuong a, tualeh akung uah “Dil gal langkhat ah galkai va ui,” achi hi. Tualeh kuongte asut ua, atawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh akitawl lai un Ama a imuta a; tualeh dil ah huipi ahing laang suh a, akuong sung uah tui adim khielkhiel a, zauhuoi tahin aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n akungah ahing pei ua, aphawng ua, “Siepa, Siepa, mangthang ding ka hita uh” achi uhi. Tuachi’n Ama ahing thou a, huipi leh tui kihot khu aphawhta a, tuachi’n atawp ua tualeh asipta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Na ginna uh hei a um ahiei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n a zau ua lamdang asa mama ua, “Tam mipa koi ahiei? Aman huipi leh tui nangawn thu apie a, Athu aman mai uh” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Galili gam gallang khat a um Gadara mite gam ahing tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Ama tuol a akumkhiet tahin, hun sawtpi dawi mat koi ahiei khat in khopi apat Ama ana lamdot a, tualeh aman puon mawngmawng asil sih a, inn ah zong aum ngai sih a, han mun lah pou ah a um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aman Jesu amu tahin akikou a, Amasangah apua a, aw ngaitah in, Jesu, Nang Pasian tungnung pen Tapa, “Kei bang hing law sawm na hiei? hing sugenthei lou dingin ka hing ngen ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu’n dawibua khu tua mipa sunga kipat pawtkhe dingin thu ana peta hi. Tua mipa khu dawiin tamveipi amanta a, tualeh miten ama aveng zing ua, Khainieng leh kol abun sah ua, hinanleh aman akigahna kolte aphutan a, gamdai ah dawi delmangin a um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Na min bang ahiei?” chi’n adong hi. Aman “Legion” achi hi, asunga dawi tampi alut ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh amaun kokhuh mongbei a pei ding a thu pelou ding in Jesu kungah angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua muna muol tungah, voh hon tampi annmai in ata uhi. Tualeh amaun vohte sunga luttheina ding phalna akungah angen uhi. Tualeh Aman aphalpiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n dawite tua mipa sunga kipat apawt ua, vohte sungah alut ua, tualeh voh hon khu dil gei ken lah ah a tai suh ua, dil ah atai lut ua, tui valin ashi siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Voh khawiten sil umdan amu tah un, atai ua, tam thu khopi leh khoneute ah ava agenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n bang thu um atai? chia en dingin mipite apawtdoh ua, Jesu kung ahing tun un, dawi matpa khu puon sil a, lungsim dihtah puo a Jesu kengbul a tou amu ua, tuachi’n azauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Dawi matpa suhdama a umdante mit a muten ama uh ana hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gadara mite gam kiim a um mipite zousie in azau mama ziehun Ama khu akung ua kipat a peimang dingin angen ua, tuachi’n Ama zong kuongah atuong a, apei kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Asunga kipat dawite pawtdohna mipain Ama kunga umden ding angen a, hinanleh Jesu’n asawlkhie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Na inn ah peikia inlen, Pasian in nang dinga sil thupitah ahing bawl pieh dan va hil in,” achi hi. Tuachi’n ama zong apeita a, Jesu’n ama a dinga sil thupitah abawl pieh dan khopi sung pumpi ah aphuongzah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesu ahing kinuale kia in, mipi in Ama ana kipahpi ua, abawn ua Ama na ngah, zing ahi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, mi khat amin Jairas kichi kikhopna inn a vaihawmpa ahing pei a, Jesu kengbul ah akhupboh a, a inn a haw dingin angen vangut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aziehpen aman tanu tangkhat kum sawm leh kum ni vel pha pan khat anei a, amanu shi dingin akisata hi. Hinanleh Jesu apei laiin mipi hon in abaw valuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh numei khat kum sawm leh kum ni si pawt, anei alam zousie daktorte kungah azangbeita a, koiman asuhdam zoulou uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Anua ah ahing pei a, apuon mong akhoi a, tuachi’n thakhat in asi pawt akangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n “Koi ahiei ahing khoi?” achi hi. Tualeh mi zousie’n kei hilou achi chiet bep un, Peter leh akunga umten, “Siepa aw, mipi hon in ahing baw valuoi ua, ahing tuom hehu uh hilou ahiei mah, Koi ahiei kei hing khoi na chi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n “Koi ahiei khat in hing khoi hi ve aw, aziehpen silbawltheina kei a kipat in apawt chi ka thei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei in akiphuol thei sih chi athei in chitun pumpumin ahing pei a, amaiah akhupboh a, akhoina zieh leh thakhat a adamtah dan mi zousie masangah agendohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n akungah, “Tanu lungnuom tahin um in; na ginna in ahing damsahta hi, hamuong tah in peita’n,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Aman thu agen zing lai in, kikhopna inn vaihawmpa inn akipat in mi khat ahing pei a, “Na tanu ashita hi, Siepa subuoi nawnda mai in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n tam thu azah tahin adawnga, akungah, “Zau sin, gingta maiin, tuachi’n adamkia ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh inn sunga lut tahin, Peter, Jakob leh Johan tualeh naupang nu leh pa chilou koima lut aphal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tualeh abawn un amanu ana kaa lieiluoi ua, amau vengvung uhi; hinanleh Jesu’n “Kap sih un, ashi ahisih a, a imu ahi zaw hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Amaun amanu ashita chi athei zieh un, zumhuoi sain anuisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n abawn un asawldoh sienga, amanu khu akhut in atu a, “Nungah thou in” chiin ahan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tuachi’n ahagau ahing kinuale kia a, thakhat in athou pai a, tualeh bang ahiei neh ding pe ding in thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tualeh anu leh apa’n lamdang asa mama ua, hinanleh Aman asilbawl khu koima hil lou dingin akhamta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n anuazui sawm leh nite ahankhawm a, dawi zousie tunga silbawltheina leh thuneina tualeh natnate suhdam theina apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman amaute Pasian gam thu gen ding leh damloute sudam dingin asawlkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Na khuolzin chiengun, chiengkhut ahiei, thungpi ahiei, tanghou ahiei, sum ahiei, bangma keng sih un, puonah zong athuop in keng sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lutna inn uah tungden unlen, tualeh tuana kipat in kipankhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh ahing na lamdawn lou pouma tua khopi akipat na peidoh chiengun amauh mawpaina etsahna dingin, na kephang ua leivui thingkhie un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n akuonta ua, khantanhoi gen kawm leh munchin a mite sudamin khochin ah apei kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Herod in asilbawl zousie ana zata a; kimkhat in Johan ahing kiata hi, achi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kimkhat in Elijah hing kilah ahita, achi ua, tualeh midangten, Nidang lai a guolneite khat hing thou kia ahita achi zieh un, alungbuoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Herod in “Johan lah alu tanta ing a, hinanleh hichi lawmlawm a athu ka zahzah nalai koi adiei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n Ama mu atumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh sawltahte ahing kinuale un, asilbawl zousiete uh Ama ahil uhi. Tuachi’n Jesu’n amauh azawpi a Bethsaida kichi khopi a koima umlouna mun sip khat ah atuom in apeipita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh mipiten athei tah un Ama azui ua; tualeh Aman amauh ana kipahpi a, akung uah Pasian gam thu ahil a, suhdam kiphamaw pouma asudam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh ni tumkuon ahing hi tahin, sawm leh nite ahing pei ua akungah, “Eite tana, mun sip a um ihi ziehun, mipite ikimvel a khopite leh khoneute a pei a giehna leh nehledawn ding sui dingin sawlkhetain,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman akung uah, “Nouten aneh ding uh pie un” achi hi. Amaun “Mipi hizapi ading iva leipieh sih leh tanghou pheng nga leh nga ni chiloungal bangma inei sih uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen mi tul nga vel ahi uhi. Tuachi’n Aman anuazuite kungah, “Sawm nga nga in, apawl pawl in tousah un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachibangin abawl ua, tualeh abawn un atousah chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman tua tanghou ngate leh nga nite ala a, van lam en touin aguolzawl a, aphalsuo a, anuazuite kungah, mipite mai a lui dingin apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n abawn un ane ua agilva chiet ua, tualeh aneh val nengte uh seu sawm leh seu ni aluoh dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu amatanga athum lai in anuazuite akungah aum ua; Aman akung uah “Mipite’n kei khu koi ahi ahing chi uoi?” chi’n adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun adawng ua, “Baptispa Johan ahing chi uh, hinanleh kimkhatten Elijah ahing chi ua, tualeh adangten nidanglai a guolneite lah a khat hing thou kia ahi ahing chi uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Ahileh nouten koi ka hi na hing chi uoi le?” achi hi. Peter in adawng a, “Pasian Khrist na hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Aman tam thu koima kunga hillou dingin khau tahin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa in sil tampi ah thuohgimna athuoh dinga, upate leh siempu liente, tualeh laigielmite deilouin a um dinga, thain a um dinga, tualeh ni thumniin athou kia ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman amaute zousie kungah, “Mi koipou in ahing zui ut uleh amaleh ama kingaisah louin nichin in akross puo in hing zui heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen koi hinanleh ahinna humbit ut in, ataan dinga, hinanleh koipou keima zieh a ahinna taanin ahumbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi’n leitung pumpi nei henlen, ama kisumang in, ahisihleh ahinna taan taleh ama adingin bang aphatuom diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Koipou keima leh ka thute zumpi khu, Mihing Tapa in Ama thupina toh, a Pa thupina toh, vansawlsiengte thupina toh, ahing pei chiengin ahing zumpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh thudihtah ka hing hil ahi, tana ding mi pawlkhat, Pasian gam amu masangsie uh shina chiem vawt lou ding a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam thute agen nua ni giet ding velin, Peter, Johan leh Jakob, azawpi a muol tung a thungen dingin apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh thungetna anei lai in amel puohdan leh amaisuo ahing kiheng lamdanga, tualeh apuonsilte avam a atesitset ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ngai vawi, mi ni Ama toh akihou ua, tuate gel khu Mosi leh Elijah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amauh thupina toh ahing kilah ua, Jerusalem a, ashina suhbukim ding thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter leh akunga umte a imut uh asuoh mama a, hinanleh ahah teitei ua, Jesu thupina leh akunga Ama toh mi ni dingte amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Jesu apeisan kuon lai un, Peter in Jesu kungah, “Pu aw, ei a dingin tana um ahoi hi, bawhinn thum i bawl dinga, Nanga dingin khat, Mosi adingin khat, tualeh Elijah a dingin khat,” achi a, bang ahiei agen chi zong theilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tambanga a genlai in, meilum ahing kai a, amauh alie a; meilum lah a alut bep un azauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n meilum lah akipat in aw khat ahing pawt a, “Tami ka Tapa deitah ahi, a thu Ngai un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh aw gin akhawl tahin, Jesu amatanga um amuta uhi. Tualeh asip dide ua, tua hun laiin asil mute uh, koima kungah, ahil sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh azing nia muol akipat ahing kum suh lai un, mipi thupitah in Ama ana dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mipi lah a kipat thakhat in mi khat akikoukhie a, “Siepa aw, ka hing ngen ahi, Ka tapa en in, ka tapa nei sun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ngai vawi, dawi in aman a thakhat khat in akikoudoh zel a, tuachi’n akama chilphuon bozen in asugenthei lenga, tualeh a sidupsah a, genthei tahin anuasie zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n na nuazuite kungah deldoh dingin ka ngen a, hinanleh adeldoh thei sih uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuabepin Jesu’n adawnga, “Ginna neiloute leh khang hilhate Aw, na kung ua bangtan vei hing umpi a, hing thuohpi ding ka hiei? Na tapa tanah hing pui in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amapa ahing peilai in dawiin tuolsenan anei a, abawl gentheita hi. Tuabepin Jesu’n hagau bua khu aphawh a, naupang khu asudam a, apa kungah apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh amaute zousie in Pasian silbawltheina thupi khu lamdang asa mama uhi. Hinanleh mi chin in Jesu silbawl zousie lamdang asah mama chiet lai un, Jesu’n anuazuite kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Tam thu kigente na bil sung uah lut heh; Mihing Tapa khu mite khuta matsah a um ding ahizieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun, a thugen atheisiem sih ua, athei louna ding ua, ama ua dinga im ahi ziehin, tualeh athugen khu Ama adong ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n alah uah koi ahiei alien pen ding chiin kiselna aneita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesu’n alungtang ua angaituo uh athei a, naupang neu khat akai a, akungah a um sah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Akung uah, “Koipou ka min zieh a tam naupang neu kipahpi khu kei hing kipahpi ahi; tualeh kei hing kipahpi khu, ahing sawlpa kipahpi ahi; Noute zousie lah a aneupen khu, athupi pen ahi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n Johan in adawnga, “Pu aw, mi khat na min a dawite deldoh ka mu ua, ka hing zuina ua apan khah lou zieh in, ka khamta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n akungah, “Ama khaam sih un, aziehpen ei hing doulou pouma ei lam a pang ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh Ama lahtou a aum ding hun ahing nai tahin Jerusalem khuo a pei ding atum chinten a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tualeh amasangah thupo ding mi asawl masa a, amauh na pei masa in Ama dinga guotsa diem a na koi dingin Samarimite khuo khat ah alutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Hinanleh amai suo khu Jerusalem lam a pei dinga akilat ziehin amaun, Ama ana kipahpi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Anuazuite Jakob le Johan in tam thu athei tah un, “Mangpa, Elijah bawlbangin amauh katum dingin, van a kipat in mei hankhesuh lei hoi nasa ei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tualeh Ama akihei a, “Amauh aphawh a, bangchibang lungsim puo na hi uoi chi na kithei sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Aziehpen Mihing Tapa mihingte hinna sumang dinga hing pei ahi sih a, hinanleh amauh hundam dinga hing pei ahi zaw hi, achi hi. Tuachi’n khodang ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tualeh lampi a apei lai un mi khat in Mangpa, “Na peina phot ah ka hing zui ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Si-alten kuo anei ua, tungleeng vaten zong bu anei uh, hinanleh Mihing Tapa in alu ngatna ding mun anei sih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tualeh Aman midang khat kungah “Hing zuiin” achi hi. Hinanleh aman, “Mangpa, ka pa hing vui sah masa phot in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Mishi in a mishi uh kivui uheh, hinanleh nangpen pei inlen Pasian gam thu va hilin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tualeh midang khat in zong, Mangpa, “Ka hing zui ding, hinanleh ka inn a mite Mangpha ka va hah masa phot ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Jesu’n akung ah, “Mi koipou loukaina langkawn akhut a tukawm a nualam en khu, Pasian gam mi hitaah ahi sih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nuain, Mangpa’n midang sawmsagi zong aguot a, Ama peina ding khochin leh mun chin ah Amasangah ni niin asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Bu lah ding atam mama a, hinanleh nasemmite atawm uhi, tuazieh in Abu la dinga nasem mite hing sawl dingin bu neipa kungah ngen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pei unlen, Ngai un, ngehon lah a belamnoute bangin ka hing sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na dangka ip uh ahiei, na thungpi uh ahiei, na kedap uh ahiei, kengsih un, tualeh lampi ah koima chibai buh sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh inn na lutna phot uah, Tam inn ah hamuonna tung heh, chi masa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh khuna lemna tapa aum leh na hamuonna thu uh atungah a um dinga; a um sih leh na kung uah ahing kilekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tuami inn ma ah um den unlen, ahing pieh pouma uh nein dawn un, aziehpen nasemmi khu athaman mutaah ahi. Inn khat akipat inn khat ah kituon kawikawi sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuo na lutna phot uah ahing kipahpi u’leh na masang ua alui pouma uh ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuna damlou umte damsah unlen, akung uah, Pasian gam na kung uah ahing tungta, chi zel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh khuo na lutna phot ua ahing na kipahpi sih uleh akhuo gawlzingte uah pei unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na khopi ua leivui ka kephang ua bangte nangawn zong noute hing dou dingin ka tatsieng uhi; ahivangin Pasian gam na kung uah ahing tungta chi thei un, na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh ka hinghil ahi, tua ni chiengin, tua khuote thuoh ding sangin, Sodom khopi thuohna khu adan aum zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Korazin, na tung agih hi! Bethsaida, na tung agih hi! Aziehpen na sung ua sil thupitah kibawlte Tai-ar leh Sidon khopite a kibawl hita leh sai ip puon sil in vut lah a touin akisia zou thamta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh vaihawm ni chiengin noute thuoh sangin Tai-ar leh Sidon thuoh khu adan a um zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Nang Kapernaum van tan a pahtawi a um ding kisa na hiei mah? Hilou, mishikhuo a sawnkhieh suh na hi zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Koipou na thugen uh ngaikhie khu, kei thu ngaikhie ahi uhi, tualeh kei hing nuol khu ahing sawlpa nuol ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n sawmsagite khu kipahtah in ahing kinuale kia ua, Mangpa, na min ziehin dawite nangawn ka thuthu un aum uh, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Setan van a kipat kawlphe banga hing kesuh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai un, gulte leh mom aite totden theina leh na melma silbawltheina zousie tunga thuneina ka hing pie hi, bangmain ahing suliem vawtsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh dawite na thuthu ua a um ziehin kipah sih unlen, van a na min uh gel ahi ziehin kipah zaw un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hunlai tahin Jesu Hagau a lungnuom in akipah mama a, “Pa aw, lei leh van Mangpa, Nangman mipil leh misiemte kungah tam thute na im a, naungehte kunga na suhlat ziehin ka hing phat ahi; ahi, Pa aw, tambang khu Nangma khotuona deidan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sil zousie ka Pa’n Kei ahing peta a, Tapa koi ahiei, chi Pa loungal koima’n athei sih; tualeh Pa koi ahiei, chi zong Tapa leh akung ua Tapa in atheisah nuomte loungal koiman athei sih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh anuazuite lam nga in akihei a, “Simtham in, na sil mute uh muna mitte ahampha hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen ka hing hil ahi, guolnei tampite leh leeng tampite’n na sil mute uh, mu ana ut ua, hinanleh amu sih uhi; tualeh na zahte uh zong zah ana ut ua, hinanleh aza sih uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai un, dan theimi khat adingdoh a, Ama ze etna in, “Siepa aw, kumtawn hinna ka mu theina dingin bang ahiei kabawl ding?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Dan laibu ah bang akigiel ei? Bang nachi sim ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman adawnga, akungah, “Mangpa na Pasian khu na lungtang zousie, na hagau zousie, na hatna zousie leh na lungsim zousie toh na it ding ahi; tualeh nangma na ki it bangin na innvengte na it ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akungah, “Na dawng dih hi, tam bangin bawl in, na hing ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh ama siemkitan nuom in Jesu kung ah, “Ka innvengte koi ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n adawnga, “Mi koi ahiei khat Jerusalem akipat in Jeriko ah apei suh a, suomhatte atuohkha a, amaun apuonte ahawhkhiet pieh ua, avaw liem ua, bupshi in anuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu khat tuami lampi ah ahing pei suh khalaizang a; ama amutahin lampi gei lang khat ah apelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuamabangin Levimi khat khum mun ahing tunga, ava en a, lampi gei lang khat ah apelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh Samari mi koi ahiei khat khuolzin lai tua mipa umna mun ah ahing pei kha a, aman amu tahin atungah lainatna aneita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Akungah ava pei a, aliemnate sathau leh uoin abuoh pieh a, atuom pieh a; ama ganta tungah atuongsah a, khuolbuh ah apeipi a akem ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh azing nia apei ding kuonin makhai ni aladoh a, khuolbuh neipa kungah apei a, ama na kem inlen, tam ban a na sen teng ka hing pei kia chiengin ka hing sang na ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam mi thumte lah ah, suomhatte tuohpa adingin koipen a innveng hi dingin na ngaituo ei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh aman, “Atunga khotuona neipa” achi hi. Tuachi’n Jesu’n akungah, “Pei inlen nang zong tuamabangin va bawl in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh lampi a apei lai un, khuo khat ah alut a, numei khat amin Martha in a inn ah ana tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n sanggam numei khat anei a amin Mari ahi, amanu Jesu kengbul ah atou a, athugente angaikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh Martha neh leh taah bawl in abuoi mama a, Jesu kungah ang pei a, “Mangpa ka sanggamnu in Keima tanga nasem a ahing ngansie khoh salou na hiei mah? Kei hing panpi dingin hing sawl ve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga amanu kungah, “Martha, Martha, sil tampi na ngaituo a buoi na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hinanleh sil khat na tasam hi, Mari in tan hoi atelta, tua khu lahpieh ding ahi sih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Jesu heisung mun ahiei khat ah thu angen a, athunget zou in anuazuite khat in akung ah, “Mangpa Johan in anuazuite ahil bangin, kou zong thunget dan ding hing hil in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akungah, “Na thunget chiengun: “Ka Pa uh van a um, Na min kizatat hen, Na gam hing tung hen, Na deilam van a akibawl bangin, Leitung ah zong kibawl hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nichin in ka neh khop uh ann hing pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tung ua leibat neite ka ngaidam mabangun, ka khelnate uh hing ngaidam in, tualeh solna ah hing puilut sinlen, gilou lah apat hing hunkhe zaw in, chi un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Na lah ua koi ahiei in lawm khat nei henlen, zankhang laiin akungah va peiin, lawm aw, tanghou pheng thum hing palah sahin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen ka lawm khat khuolzin ahing tunga, amai a lui pieh ding bangma ka nei sih hi, chi henlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh innsunga um pa’n dawngin, hing subuoi sin, tun vang kot kha ahita, Ka tate zong ka kungah lupna ah a imuta uh, thouin ka hing pe thei sih chiin dawngta leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi, alawm ahiziehin vathouin vape sih nanleh, anget teitei ziehin, vathouin adei zaza ava pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi ngen un piehin na um ding uh, sui un, na mu ding uh, tualeh kiu un, honpieh in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen angen pouma pieh in a um a, asui poumain amu hi, tualeh akiu pouma akihonpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lah ua pa khat pou in, atapa in tanghou ngenta leh koi ahiei suong pe ding? ahisihleh nga ngen leh nga taangin gul ape diei le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahisihleh aatui ngen leh mom ai ape diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachia Nou migilouin bawn na tate u’kunga sil hoi pieh dan na thei uleh, na Pa uh van a um in angen mite kungah Hagau Siengthou atamzaw tham hing nahpieh zawsem lou ding ahiei mah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n dawi ham theilou khat anotdoh a, tualeh dawi apawtdoh bepin hamtheilou khu ahing hamta a; tuachi’n mipi in lamdang asa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh pawlkhat in “Dawimangpa Beelzebub zieh a dawite adeldoh ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh mi dangten Ama ze etna in van a kipat chiemtena angen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman angaituo uh athei a, akung uah, “Leenggam chinteng ama leh ama kidou pouma amangthai leng uhi, tualeh inn sung khat zong akidou uleh apua leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Setan zong ama leh ama kidou taleh bangchin agam ading thei diei? Aziehpen Beelzebub zieh a dawite ka deldoh ahi na hing chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Ken Beelzebub zieh a dawite notdoh ka hileh, na tapate un koi zieh a ana deldoh zel uh ahiei? Tuaziehin amauh khu noute vai hing hawmpieh dingte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Ken Pasian khutme zieha dawite deldoh ka hileh, Pasian gam na kung uah ahing tung tahtah ta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihat in galvankim tawi a, a innpi aven leh anei alamte abit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh ama sanga hatzaw khat ahing pei a, abulu a, azawchiengin akimuonna agalvan zousie alah pieh a, tualeh anei alam alahpiehte ahawmzah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei lam a panglou pouma, Kei hing dou ahi a, tualeh koipou ahing lahkhawmpi lou in athezah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Dawibua mi sunga kipat apawtdoh chiengin, khawlna ding sui in gamgaw mun ah avah kawikawi a, amu sih a; ka hing pawtdohna ka inn ah ka kinuale mai ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh khuna ahing tun in, phiet siengsa leh hoitah a kizem amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n apei a, ama sanga gilou zaw dawi dang sagi ahing zawpi a, asungah alut ua, atengta uhi; tualeh tua mipa umdan amasang a sangin ahing sezaw semta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, tam thute agen lai in mipi lah akipat in numei koiahiei khat ahing kikoudoh a, “Nang hing kipaina gil leh na nawitep khu ahampha hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman tuate sangin “Pasian thu za a zuite ahampha zaw uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh mipi nasatah ahing kikhop khawm lai un, Jesu’n “Tulai khangthate pen khang giloutah ahi uh; chiemtena asui ua, hinanleh guolnei Jonah chiemtena loungal chiemtena dang pieh ahisih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen Jonah khu Nineveh khuo a mite dinga chiemtena ahi bangin, Mihing Tapa zong tulai khangthate dingin chiemtena ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Vaihawm ni chiengin simlam kumpinu khu tulai khangthate toh ahing ding ding a; amauh amawpai ding hi; aziehpen amanu Solomon pilna ngaikhe dingin kawlmong a kipat in ahing pei hi; Ngai un, Solomon sanga thupi zaw tanah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thukhen ni chiengin Nineveh khuo a mite khu tulai khangthate toh ading ding ua, siemmaw atangsah ding uhi; amauh Jonah thugen ziehin akhelnate uh akisia uhi, Ngai un, Jonah sanga thupi zaw tanah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Mi koima’n meivah adet chiengin mun simtham leh law nuoi ah akoi ngai sih hi, ahing lutten amu theina dingun, meivah tunna ah akoi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na tahsa meivah khu na mit ahi, na mit ahoi laisie na tahsa pumpi abawn in avah suoh hi, hinanleh na mit ahoilou chiengin na tahsa pumpi zong amiel sieng zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaziehin na sunga vah um khu amiel ahilou na dingin pilvangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua hileh na tahsa pumpi amielna mun umlou a, avah suoh leh, meivah in ahing tan vah bangin avah suoh sieng ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh athugen lai in, Pharisai koi ahiei khat in akunga ann ne dingin Ama achiel a, tuachi’n alut a, ann ne dingin atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Pharisaipa’n a ann neh masanga akhut asil masah lou amu in lamdang asa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n akungah, “Nou pharisaiten nou leh kuong pulam na silsieng nguttah ua, hinanleh na sunglam ulah, lepguhna leh gitlouna in adim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nou mimote aw, apulam bawlpa’n, asunglam zong abawl sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hinanleh nou leh kuong sung a umte migentheite kungah pezaw unlen, tuachi’n Ngai un, sil zousie nou a dingin asiengthousa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Hinanleh Pharisaite aw, na tunguh agih hi! aziehpen nouten leengmasel leh Pasikhawmte nasan leh haichi zousie sawma khat na pie ua, vaihawmna dih leh Pasian itna na thudon sih uhi. Tamte ahi na bawl ding uh, adangte bawllou tuonlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nou Pharisaite na tunguh agih hi; kikhopna innte ah touna hoipente leh vanzuona mun laha mi’n ahing chibai ding na ut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nou laigielmite leh Pharisai lepchiete aw, na tunguh agih hi! Aziehpen noute pen, mi’n hankhuh ahilam thei vateh lou a, atunga lampi ahahna uh akimulou hankhuh bang na hi uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n alah ua dansiemmi khat in adawnga akungah, “Siepa, tam na thugen in Koute zong na hing phawh kha hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh Aman “Nou dansiemte zong na tunguh agih hi, aziehpen noute’n vangih puo hasa tahtah mi na guon ua, nouma’n lah tua puohgihte na khutme khat un zong na khoi nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Na tunguh agih hi, aziehpen na pu na pate un athasa uh, guolneite han inn na lampieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh silbawlte na theipi ua, hoi nasahpi tahtah uhi; amaun ana that ua nouten ahan uh na lampieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian pilnain zong, Akung uah guolneite leh sawltahte, ka sawl ding a alah ua, pawlkhat ana that ding ua, pawlkhat abawl genthei ding uh achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Leitung siemchil a kipat a guolnei sisan kisuo zousie, tulai khangthate tungah phu akila thei ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Abel sisan kisuo akipat maitam leh biehinn kikaal a shi Zekariah sisan dongin, achi hi, Ahi, ka hing hil ahi, tam phuba tulai khangthate tungah akila ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Nou dansiem mite aw na tunguh agih hi! aziehpen nouten pilna chabi na pei mangpi ua, nouma lah na lut sih ua, mi lut ding lah na khaam zel uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Khuna kipat a Jesu apawtdoh tahin laigiel mite leh Pharisaiten Ama aphin panta ua, sil tampi gensah atum ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Aheh theina dingun, ahamkhielna mat tum in, abuhdap denta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuabang hun lai a mipi simsenglou khat leh khat kituonchil khop hiel a ahing kikhop khawm laiun Aman amasapenin anuazuite kungah, “Pharisaite lepchiena tol lah ah pilvang un, achi panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen langlou dinga, phuolguh bangma a um sih a, tualeh theilou dinga im zong bangma a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin miel a na gen pouma uh vah a zah in a um ding a, tualeh inndan sunggila bilkawma na gen uh, inntungvum a tangkoupiin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tualeh nou ka lawmte ka hinghil ahi, tahsa thatlum thei a anua a bangma bawlthei nawnloute giing sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh koi ahiei na giin ding uh ka hing hil ding hi, athalup nua ua zong gawtmuna paitheina thuneipa giing un, ahi, ka hinghil ahi Ama giing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vatou nga paisa san niin azua zel uh hilou ahiei mah? Hinanleh alah ua khat zong Pasian mai ah manghil in a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh na lu ua samzamte nangawn abawn a sim siengsa ahi uh. Tuaziehin zau sih un; vatou tampite sangin na manpha zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tualeh ka hinghil ahi, koipou mite mai a kei hing hum pouma, Mihing Tapa in zong Pasian vansawlsiengte mai ah ama ahum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh mite mai a hing kitheimawbawlte khu Pasian vansawlsiengte mai ah kitheimawbawlin a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Mihing Tapa gensietna thu gen pouma ngaidam ahi ding ua, hinanleh Hagau Siengthou gense pouma agensietna khu ngaidam ahisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n noute kikhopna innte leh thukhente, tualeh thuneite kunga ahing pui tah chiengun, bang ka gen in bang ka chi dawn diei, chiin lungdong sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen Hagau Siengthouin tua hun tahin na gen ding uh ahinghil ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite lah a khat in akungah, “Siepa aw, Ka sanggampa kungah gou hing kihoppi dingin gen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman akungah, “Mihing aw, Koiin ahiei kei noute tunga thukhen ahiei, tanhawmpiehpa ding ahiei a hing guot?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Pilvang unlen, enna lah ah kiveng un, aziehpen hausatna khu mihing damsan ahi sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Gente thu khat agen a, Mi hausa koi ahiei khat khu alou a pieng ahing pung mamata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh akingaituota a, ka bulebal koina ding lah ka nei sih a, bang law ding kata diei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n tami ka bawl ding hi: Ka bu inn phet vangin, alienzaw in lam vangin khunah ka bulebalte leh ka nei ka lam zousie abawnin koi vang, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ka hagau kungah, Hagau, kum tampi a dingin nei lelam tampi na kholkhawmta hi, kitawldam inlen, nein dawnin, tualeh nuom tahin umin, ka chi ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in akungah, Nang mimo, tuzan chiengin na hinna hing kilahpieh ding ahi, Tuahileh na sil kholkhawmte zousie koi a ding ahita diei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin ama a ding maimai a gou kholkhawm a Pasian lam a hausa lou khu tuabang ahi zel uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman anuazuite kungah, “Tuazieh in ka hing hil ahi, bang ka ne diei chiin na hinna, ding uleh, bang ka sil diei, chiin na tahsa ua dingin lungdong sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Neh ding sangin hinna athupi zaw a, tualeh tahsa zong puonsil sangin athupi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Va-ahte ngaituo un, bu lah atu sih ua, at zong a at sih uh, bupang leh tangsal zong anei sih uh; hinanleh Pasian in amauh avaa hi. Noute vate sanga bangzata a, manphazaw na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh na lah ua koi ahiei alunggim zieh a adunglam tong khat a belap a susang thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuabanga sil neunou khat nangawn na bawl thei sih uleh, bang dinga adangte lunggimpi na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lili pahte khandan ngaituo un, nna asem sih ua, mui zong azom sih uhi, hinanleh ka hing hil ahi, Solomon zong athupina zousie toh akizepin zong, tam lili pahte laha khat banga zepin a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n gam laha hampa tunia hing pou a, azingni chienga lungthukhua a pai a haltum mai ding bawn Pasian in hichi va-ia a azep leh nou ginna tawmte aw, bangchituh a noute silsah a um ding na hita uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh na neh ding uh ahiei, na dawn ding uh ahiei, sui sih un, ginlana lungsim nei in zong um sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen leitung pumpi a namten zong tam silte zousie asui uh, tualeh na Pa un tam silte na tulmaw uh chi athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten Pasian gam sui zawun; tuachi’n tam silte ahing kipieh be ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Pawl tawmte aw, zau sih un, aziehpen na kung ua, leenggam pieh ding khu na Pa uh kipahna lamtah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na nei teng uh zua unlen, migentheite kungah pie un, van ah gutate peilouna leh leikhaten anehsiet thei louna ah, dangka ip lui theilou leh gou setheilou kikhol zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aziehpen na gou umna uah, na lungtang u’zong a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Na kawng uh gah unlen, tualeh na thaumei u’zong de kuong zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi’n apu uh moulopna akipat a ahing kilekia a, kotkha ahing kiu tah chieng a na honpieh thei pai dinga na ngah zingte bangin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Apu uh ahing pei chienga ama ngah zinga amu suohte ahampha uhi; chitahtahin ka hinghil ahi, Aman akawng agah dinga, ann ne dingin atou sah dinga, a neh uh abawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zankhanglai in ahiei zingthaw hun ahieiin hing pei taleh, tuabanga ahing mu suohte khu ahampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh tami thei un, guta hing pei ding hun inn neipa’n thei leh, aveng dinga, a inn aphenvang sah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaziehin nou zong kigingsa in um un, aziehpen na gintatlou laitah un, Mihing Tapa hing pei ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in akungah, “Mangpa tam gentena thu koute ding maimai a na gen ahiei, ahisihleh mi zousie ding a zong na gen ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Mangpa’n sumkempa ginum leh piltah, apu in ahunchina atan ding uh hawm pieh dinga a innkuon pite tunga vaihawm dinga abawl khu koipen ahi diei le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Apu ahing pei chienga suoh tuabanga bawl ahing mu dingpa khu ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Na kung uah thutah ka hinghil ahi, Ama khu anei zousie tunga vaihawm dingin abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hinanleh tua suohpain alungsim in, ka pu hing pei zuai sih nava chiin asuohpasalte leh asuohnumeite na vuain, tualeh ne a dawn in na khamta leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua suohpa pu khu agintat lou ni khat in, atheilou kaal in ahing pei dinga, tun ni asuo dinga, ginglou mite tan bang atangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh suoh apu deilam thei napi a, ana kiginglou leh adeilam banga bawl lou khu tamveipi vuoh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hinanleh theiloupi a vuohna tham hiel a sil bawlpakhu tawmnoukhat vei vuoh in aum ding hi. Aziehpen tampi pieha um mi pouma kungah tampi akiphut dinga, tualeh mi’n tampi akepsahpa uh kungah atamzawsem aphut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Leitunga meikuong sawl dinga hing pei ka hi; tuin zong kuong panta leh chi sam ing e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hinanleh baptisma tan ding khat ka nei hi, tuami ka suhtangtun masangsie’n ka ning kitel hina va-ia e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Leitung a lemna leengsah ding a hing pei hiva na hing chi uh amah? Hikeilou, ka hing hil ahi, kikhenna umsah ding a hing pei ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua kipat in innsung khat a mi nga umna ah kikhenna a um dinga, mi thum in nite a dou dinga, niin thum adou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Pa in tapa, tapa in pa, nuin, tanu, tualeh tanuin nu; innpinuin amounu tualeh amounu in ainnpinu, adou ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman mipite kungah zong, “Nouten nitumna lam a meilum hing kai na mu chiengun guo zu ding ahi na chi pai ua, tuabangin ahing um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tualeh sim hui hing laang na mu chiengun khuo hing lum ding hi e, na chi ua, tuabangin ahing lum zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nou milepchiete aw, lei leh van umdan na theisiem ngal ua, bang dinga tulai hun umdan theisiem lou na hi uoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />“Tualeh bang dinga nouten nouma tungtang a thudih kikhenlou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Na kihehpipa toh thukhenpa kunga na pei chiengin, lamkaal ah, ama toh kilep theina ding khat ngaituo teitei in, tuachilou in vang thukhenpa mai ah ahing tut dinga, thukhenpa’n mi man lamkaipa kungah ahing pekhe dinga, tuachi’n mi man lamkaipa’n suongkul ah ahing khum kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi, paisasan khat nangawn na pieh kim masangsie in, tuana kipat na pawtdoh nawn sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun lai in, Galili gam a mite sisan Pilat in akithoina sa u’toh ahalpieh thu Jesu kunga hing hil mi hunkhop a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu’n adawng a akung uah, “Tuabang silte athuoh ziehun Galilimite khu Galili gam a mite zousie sanga khielzaw dieha ngaituo na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hilou e, ka hing hil ahi nou zong na kisia sih uleh, tuabangmain na mangthai sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahisihleh Siloam innsangin apuakhum a anetlia mi sawmle giette zong Jerusalem khuo a umte zousie sanga khielzawdieh a ngaituo na hi uoi mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hilou e, ka hing hil ahi, noute zong na kisia sih uleh, tuabangma in na mangthai sieng ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman tam gentena thu zong agen a, “Mi koiahiei khat in a grep huon ah theipi kung kisuon khat anei a; tualeh aga ahing sui a, khat zong amu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman grep huon kempa kungah, En vawi, kum thum sung tami theipi kungah aga ka va sui zel a, khat zong ka mu sih hi, phua mai in, bangdinga mun teng dep a um ahiei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh aman adawnga, akungah, Pu aw, tukum sung zong hichiin um sah tadi in, akimkot in lei tou phot vangin bawng eeh in ka phungvua tadi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahing ga tahleh ahoi ahi dinga, hinanleh ahing ga taah sih leh na phua na ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman khawlni in kikhopna inn khat ah thu ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, khunah, kum sawm leh kumgiet hatlouna dawi in amat numei khat a um a, a ngum kuul khiukheu a, ama thuin adingtang thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesu’n amanu amu tahin ahan a, akungah, “Numei, na hatlouna a kipat hakhiet na hita” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Aman atungah akhut akoi a, tuachi’n thakhat in adingtang pai a, Pasian a pahtawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh khawlni a Jesu’n mi asuhdam ziehin kikhopna inn a vaihawmpa’n lungthah pum in, “Mihingte nasepna ding ni guh um hilou ahiei mah; tua hun sungin hing pei unlen, hing kisudam ta un, khawlni hi sese louin” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabepin Mangpa’n ama adawnga, “Nang milepchie! Khawlni in na bawngtal uh ahisihleh na sabiltung uh akikhina apat sutkhiein tui dawnsah dingin na puidoh zel uh hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam numei Abraham tanu ahi thuoi a, Ngai vawi, Setan in kum sawm leh kumgiet akhina khu khawlni a akolbuna sutpieh lou dan ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachia Aman tam thute agen tahin, amelmate zousie azumta ua, tualeh mipite zousie, A sil bawl thupite zousie ziehin akipah chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman “Pasian gam khu bangchi bang ahiei? tualeh bang toh gente ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam pen min ankam tang khat alah a, ahuona athe bang ahi, tua khu ahing poua, akhang lien a, sing lienpi ahing hi a, tungleeng vaten abazamte ah bu asep uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh “Pasian gam khu bang toh gente ding ka hiei? achi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam pen numei khat in tol alaah a, tena thum dim ann lah a, abawn a azel suoh masangsie aphum bang ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Aman thuhil pumin khopi leh khoneute atuon kawikawi a, Jerusalem lang zuon in apei zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi khat in akungah, “Mangpa hundam dingte tawmnoukhat ahi uh ama leh?” achi hi. Tualeh Aman akung uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Kot kochih ah lut tum teitei un, aziehpen ka hinghil ahi, mi tampiin lut a tum ding ua, alut thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Inn neipa khatvei ahing thaw a kot akha nua chiengin, noute apulam a dingin, Mangpa Mangpa kot hing honin, chia kot na kiu chiengun, Aman heilang mi na hi uoi, ka hing thei ngai sih, chiin ahing dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin nouten na masang ah ka ne un, ka dawn ua, tualeh ka gawldungte uah thu na hil zel ve le, na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman, ka hinghil ahi, heilang mi nahi uoi mah ka hing thei sih; nou silgilou bawlte zousie, ka kunga kipat peimang un, ahing chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abraham, Isaak, Jakob leh guolneite zousie, Pasian gam a um na mu ua, noute pulam a paikhieh a um na hi uh na hing kithei chiengun, khunah kaa leh hagawtna a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh suolam leh tumlam, mallam leh simlam a pat in mite ahing pei ding ua, Pasian gam ah atou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai un, anukhia pente zong amasa pen a pang ding a um uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ni mama in Pharisai koite ahiei ahing pei ua, akungah, “Pawt inlen, tam mun apat peimangin; aziehpen Herod in tha ahing tum hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Pei unlen tua si al kungah va hil un, Ngai in, tuni leh zing chiengin dawite ka notdoh dinga, natnate zong ka sudam dinga, ni thum niin ka nasep ka zou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahivang in, tuni toh zing chieng toh thai ni toh ka pei zel ding hi; aziehpen Jerusalem khuo pulam a guolnei shi ngaina ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, Jerusalem! guolneite that leh na kung a hing kisawlte suonga na seplia; aapi in anoute ahanuoi a a opkhum bangin, bangzavei na tate opkhum ka tum a, hinanleh na ut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />En un, na inn uh ahawm a nuasie in a umta hi; tualeh chitahtah in ka hinghil ahi, Mangpa min a hing pei khu ahampha hi, na chi masangsie uh, na hing mu sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Khawlni in Pharisai vaihawmpa khat inn a ann ne dinga apeiin amaun a enkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh En vawi, amasangah chipawm a damlou mi khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu’n dansiemmite leh Pharisaite ahoupi a akung uah, “Khawlni in suhdam sieng ahiei, sienglou?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh amauh asip dide ua; tualeh Aman damlou khu atu a, asudam a, apei sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n akung uah, “Na lah uah koi ahiei na sabiltung uh ahiei, na bawngtal uh ahiei, kokhuh ah ketaleh, khawlni a kaikhe pai lou ding?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh tam thute amaun adawng thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n ami chielte un touna mun nuom pen atel zel uh amu a, akung uah gentena thu agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kitenna mou pawi a koi ahieiin ahing chiel chiengun touna mun hoipen ah tou sih un, tuachilouin nang sanga mi zatat huoi zaw khat ana chielkha ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang hing chielpa leh ama na kungah ahing pei ding ua, tam mipa touna ding awn in ahing chi dinga, tuachi’n nang zumtah in mun hoilou pen ah na toupan phing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh ahing kichiel chiengin pei inlen touna ngiem pen ah na vatou zaw ding a, tuachi’n nang hing chielpa ahing pei chiengin, na kung ah, lawm, touna mun sangzaw ah touin ahing chi thei ding hi. Tuachi’n na ann nehpite mitmuin pahtawi in na um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Koipou ama kingaisang khu angiem dinga, tualeh ama kingaingiem pouma tawisangin a um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman achielpa kungah zong, “Sun ahiei, zan ahiei a, annkuong na lui chiengin, na lawmte, na sanggamte, na hieng nasante, ahisihleh na innveng mihausate, chiel sin, tuachilouin amaun zong ahing chiel ding ua, ahing thuh kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh annkuong na lui chiengin, tagate, mizawngte, piengsuolte, kengbaite, tualeh mittote chiel zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun ahing thuh zou lou zieh in na hampha dinga, aziehpen midihtatte thokia chiengin thuh in na um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh a annkuong impite khat in tam thute azah tahin akungah, “Pasian gam a ann ne dingte khu ahampha hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akungah, “Mi koi ahiei khat in annkuong luina abawl a, mi tampi achiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh nitah anneh hun in, a mi chielte kung a, hing peita un, tuin bangkim akimanta hi, vachi dingin asuohpa asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun kithutuoh tahin suonlam anei chiet uhi. Amasapen in akungah, Lou ka leita a, a en dinga ka va kuon akiphamaw hi, na hing ngaisiem kang ngen hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Adangin Bawngtal kop nga ka leita a, ahoi leh hoilou en dinga ka vakuon akiphamaw hi; na hing ngaisiem kang ngen hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh adang khat in zi ka neita a, tuaziehin ka hing pei thei sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n a suohpa ahing pei a, tam thute apu ahing hilta hi. Tuabepin inn neipa a lungthah a, asuohpa kungah, kintahin pei inlen gawldung leh khopi sung ningkawm lah a, mizawngte, piengsuolte, mittote leh kengbaite tanah hing puilut in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh asuohpa’n pu Nang thupieh bangin ka bawl zouta hi, hinanleh mun a awng nalai hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n a puin asuohpa kungah, lamlien leh daigei ah pei inlen, ka inn adim theina dingin mi hing zawllut teitei in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi, ka mi chielte khatbehin zong ka annkuonglui achiem sih ding uh,” achi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh mipi thupitahin Ama azawpi ua, tualeh Ama akihei a, akung uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mi koipou ka kunga hing peiin, apa, anu, azi, atate, asanggampa, asanggam nu tualeh ama hinna nangawn ahuot sihleh ka nuazui ahi thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh koi zong ama kross kipuoh a hing zuilou khu ka nuazui ahi thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Noute lah a koipou in innsang lam tumin alam zouna ding sum anei leh neilou theina dinga tou masa phot a, alut dingza tuot masa lou ding koi na um uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachilouin suongphum phum zou phot a, alamzou thei sih leh a en poumain anuisan ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tam mipa’n inn lam apanta ngal a, azou thei sih, achi kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahisihleh leengpa koi ahiei leeng dang khat dou dinga kuon dingin, tou masa phot a, ama dou dinga mi tulsawmni toh hing kuonpa lamtuoh ngam ding leh ngam lou ding, ngaituo masa lou ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahisih vanglah leh adangpen gamlapi a aum laiin kilemna thuchiem ngen dingin patong asawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachimabangin noute lah ah zong koipouin anei zousie peisan lou khu ka nuazui ahithei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Chi khu ahoi a, ahivangin chi khu tam taleh bangchin aki al sahta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lei a dingin lah ahoi sih a, eehvum dingin lah ahoi tuom sih ding, mi’n apaidoh zaw zel uhi. Koipou zahna ding bil neiin za uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n sie dongmite leh mikhielte zousie in athu ngaikhe dingin akunglam ahing zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pharisaite leh laigielmiten, “Tam mipa’n mikhielte akigoppi a, ann aneh khawmpi hi chiin a phunchiehta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, tam gente thu agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Noute lah a koi ahiei in belam za nei henlen, alah a khat mangsah taleh, sawmkuo leh kuote gamdai a nuasie a, amangpen amu masangsie va sui lou ding koi na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh amu kia tahin kipahtahin aliengkou ah apuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh inn atuntahin, alawmte leh a innvengte ahan khawma akung uah, Hing kipahpi un, ka belam mang ka mu kiata hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi, tuachimabangin midih kisiana tuon ding neilou sawmkuo leh kuote tung sangin mikhiel khat kisiana tungah van ah kipahna a lien zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tualeh numei koi ahiei in dangka sawm nei henlen khat mangsah taleh meivah de a inn phiet in amu kia masangsie lunglut tah a sui lou ding koi ahiei um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh amu kia chiengin alawmte leh a innvengte ahankhawm a, hing kipahpi un, ka dangka mansah ka mu kiata hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi, tuachimabangin Pasian vansawlsiengte masang ah mikhiel kisia khat tungah kipahna a um hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman “Mi koi ahiei in tapa ni anei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anaupang zaw pen in apa kung ah, Pa Kei tan ding gou teng hing piein achi hi. Tuachi’n apa’n asum khu ahawm piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh ni sawtlou nuain tapa naupang zaw pa’n atan teng abawnin alakhawm a khuol gamlapi ah azinta a, tua mun ah anei zousie noptat tahin azang bei siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh azah bei sieng tahin khum gam ah kiel thupitah ahing tunga, neh ding ahing kitasamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama apei a khum gam mi khat ava belta a, tuachi’n aman ama khu voh ann pe dingin alou lang ah ana sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh vohte neh begapsau hawte a agil vasah a ut mama a, koiman lah bangma ape sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh ama leh ama ahing kiphawhkhiet tahin, Ka pa kunga kilaw suohte ann neh senglou nei atam tam u’toh, Kei lah tana gilkiel a shi ding hita mai veng in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thou ding a, ka pa kungah ka pei dinga, akungah, “Pa aw van a tungah leh nangma mitmu in sil ka bawl khielta;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tapa chi taah zong ka hi nawn sih, na kung a kilaw na suohte khat bangin hing bawlin, ka chi ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n athoua, apa kungah ahing peita hi. Hinanleh gamlapi a aum lai in apa’n ana mu a, alainat mama a, ana del a, a ngawngkawi a, tualeh atawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n atapa’n akungah, Pa aw van a tung ah leh nangma mitmuin sil ka bawlkhielta hi; na tapa chi taah zong ka hi nawn sih, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh a pa’n asuohte kungah puontuol hoi penpen kintahin hing ladoh unlen, silsah un, akhut ah khutsip but sah unlen, akengah kengdap bun sah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh bawngnou thautah tanah hing la unlen, gou un, tuachi’n ine ding ua, kipah tahin i um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen tam ka tapa ashi a ahing hingkiata hi; amanga akimu kiata hi, achi hi. Tuachi’n kipahtahin a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tualeh atapa upazaw pen lou ah a um hi. Inn ahing tun kuon in tumging leh lam husa azata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n asuohte khat ahan a, Tamte bang china atai leh? chiin adongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh aman akungah, na nau ahing tunga chidam lu dam a amukia ziehin na pa’n bawngnou thautah agou hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama khu alungthah ta a, alut nuom ta sih hi. Tuaziehin apa ahing pawtdoh a, ahing zawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman adawnga, apa kungah, Ngai in, kum hitan veipi na nna sem ing a, na thupiehte lah khat zong palsan ngailou inga; ka lawmte toh guolnop ka bawlna dingin kelnou khat nangawn zong na hing pe ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh tam na tapa, kizuate kunga na neina lam teng va netum siengpa ahing tun tahin ama a dingin bawngnou thautah na gou pai viel a, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n apa’n akungah, ka tapa nang pen ka kunga um ngitnget na hi a, Ka nei zousie zong nang a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kipahtah leh nuomtah a i um ding hizawlou ahiei mah? Tam na nau ashi a, ahing hingkiata hi, amanga i mu kiata ahi, achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Jesu’n anuazuite kungah, “Tam thu zong agen a, Mi hausa koi ahiei in sumkempa khat anei a, tua mipa’n asum amawh thangzah sieng pieh ta hi, chiin akungah hehna ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman amapa ahan a, a kungah, Na tungtang thu ka zah khu bangchi dan ahiei? Na sum kep tuotna dan hing pelut in, tubansie sumkem a pang nawnlou ding na hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n sumkempa’n alungsim in, Bangchi ding kata diei? Ka pu in ka sum kep hing tawpsah ding ahita a, lei lai ding lah ka ngap sih a, khutdaw ding lah ka zumin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sumkep ahing tawpsah chienga, a inn ua ahing um sah theina dingin, ka bawl dan ding ka theita, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n apu sum bate zousie akungah ahan chiet a, amasapen kungah ka pu sum bangza ahiei na bat? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman sathau tena za khat achi hi. Tuachi’n aman akungah, na lai la zuai inlen, tou inlen, kintah in sawmnga gielin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh adang khat kungah, Nang bangza ahiei na bat? achi hi. Aman bu tena za khat achi hi. Tuachi’n aman akungah, na lai la inlen sawmgiet giel in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua sumkem dihtat lou pa’n lemgel theitah a abawl ziehin apahtat ta hi. Aziehpen vah tate sangin tam leitung tate atulai khang thu uah apilzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh ka hing hil ahi, dihtatlouna sumin na lawm dinguh kibawl un, hausatna abei hun chienga kumtawna umna a noute ahing umsah theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Koizong tawmnou khat tunga gin um khu tampi tung ah zong a gin um ahi, tualeh koizong tawmnoukhat tunga gin umlou khu tampi tungah zong agin um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin dihtatlouna sum tunga na gin um sih u’leh, koi ahiei noute hing muonga sumtah hing kem sah ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh midang neisa tunga bawn na gin um sih u’leh koiin ahiei nouma a tahtah hing pe ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Suoh khat in Pu ni nna asem khawm thei sih; aziehpen khat muda in khat a it ding a, ahisihleh khat hum in khat asimmaw kha ding hi. Pasian nna leh sum nna na sem khawm thei sih ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Pharisai sum ngainaten zong tam thute zousie aza ua, Ama anuisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Noute pen mite mitmu a kisiem tangsahte na hi uhi. Hinanleh Pasian in na lungtang uh athei hi; aziehpen mite laha kitawisang khu Pasian mitmu a kidahhuoi tah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Dan leh guolneite thu khu Johan hing um tan chieng aum a, tua bansie Pasian gam khantanhoi thu akigen a, tualeh michinin tuanah apaulut sawm chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh dan thu sut vom neunou khat aman sangin, lei leh van amanthai abailam zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Koipou azi khul a, zi dang kitenpi pouma angkawm ahi; tualeh koipou apasal in akhulsa kitenpi pouma angkawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mihausa koi ahiei khat a um a, puon sandup leh puon malngat asil a, ni chin in nuomsa tahin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh amin Lazar kichi apumtanga hima a dim mi hausapa kotpi bul a alupsah zel uh khutdaw khat a um a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi hausapa dawkan a akipat khateneng kia pou neh a kigilva sah alunggul hi. Tuathamlouin uite ahing pei ua, ahimate alieh piehzel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, tua khutdawpa ashi a, vansawlsiengten Abraham angsungah a peipi uhi. Mi hausapa zong ashi a akivui ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh mishi khuo ah gimthuohin a um a, adah tou a, gamlapi a Abraham leh a angsung a Lazar um khu amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n akikou a, Pa Abraham Kei hing khotuo inlen, Lazar in akhutme dawn tui ah hing die henlen ka lei suvot dingin hing sawl in, tam meikuongah ka thuohgim sengta hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Abraham in Tapa nangman na dam lai in sil hoite na kimu a, tuamabangin Lazar in sil hoiloute amu hi, chi geldohin, hinanleh tuin vang ama hamuonin a um a, nang pen gimthuohin na um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh tamte chilou zong, koute leh noute kikaal ah guom thupitah a um hi; tua khu tamlang gal a kipat noute kunga hing pei utte ahing pei theilouna ding u’leh, tualang gal a kipata kou kunga hing pei utte, ahing pei thei louna ding un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ahileh, Pa ama khu ka pa inn a sawl dingin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen sanggam pasal nga ka nei a, amauh vahil leh tuachilou in ama u’zong tam gim thuohna mun ah ahing pei kha ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abraham in akungah, amaun Mosi leh guolneite anei uhi, tuate thu na ngaikhie uheh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Hilou e, Pa Abraham, mishi lah kipat mi khat va pei leh akisia ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh aman akungah, Mosi leh guolneite thu angaikhiet nuom sih u’leh, mishi lah akipat mi khat thoukia nanleh zong atahsang tuom sih ding uhi, achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n anuazuite kungah, “Puanate ahing tunglou thei ahi sih hi, hinanleh puana um sahpa tung agih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam mi neute laha khat apuasah sangin angawng ah bu hehna suongsum awsahin tuipi sungah kipailut leh ama a dingin ahoizaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilvang un, na sanggampa’n na tunga sil abawlkhiel leh phawhhil inlen, akisia leh ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni khat sunga sagi vei na tunga sil abawlkhiel a, sagivei na kunga ka kisia hi achi a, nanglam a ahing kihei kia leh na ngaidam ding ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh sawltahten Mangpa kungah, “Ka ginna uh khangsah in,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n “Ankam tang khat chie ginna na nei uleh tam kawlsathau kung kungah, hing kiphungkal inlen tuipi sungah pouin, na chi ding ua, na thu uh amang mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Noute lah a koi ahiei in, loukai ahiei, ahisihleh belamching ahiei, suoh khat nei henlen, lou apat ahing vaitun chieng a, Ann va kineh pai aw, chi ding koi na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualemahin, ka neh ding bawl inlen, puon teng inlen, ka neh a ka dawn zou masangsie ka neh kataah bawl in, tuazou chiengin nangman na nein na dawn na ding hi, chizaw lou ding na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua suohpan abawl ding thu kipete banga abawl ziehin kipah thu na gen ei le? Ka gingta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachimabangin nouten zong na kung ua thupieh zousie na bawl zou chiengun, suoh phatuomlou ka hi uh ka bawl ding mawnguh bawl ka hi uh, chi un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu Jerusalem zuon a apei lai in, Samaria leh Galili gamgi zuul atuon suoh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n khuo khat a alut kuon in, pha ngentang mi sawm in ana dawn ua, amaute gamlapi ah ading ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh aw ngaitah in akikou ua, “Siepa Jesu aw, koute hing khotuoin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh amu tahin, Aman akung uah, “Pei unlen siemputen va ki en sah un,” achi hi. Tuachia apei lai un ahing siengthouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh alah ua khat in adamta chi akithei tahin anuakia kia a, aw ngaitah in Pasian apahtawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu kengbul ah akhupboh a, kipah thu agen a, tua mipa khu Samari mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n adawnga, “Mi sawm hing siengthouta na hisih uh amah? Hinanleh kuote hei a umta?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam gamdang mipa chilou, Pasian pahtawi ding a hing kinualekia koima kimu khatalou hiven maw?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akungah, “Thou inlen peita’n, na ginna in ahing damsahta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Pharisaiten Pasian gam hing tun hun ding adoh u’leh, Aman adawng a akung uah, “Pasian gam pen mu theiin ahing tung sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />En un, tanah, ahisihleh En un, khunah, zong achi sih ding uhi, Aziehpen ngai un, Pasian gam khu na lah uah a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman anuazuite kungah, “Mihing Tapa damlai nite ni khatbeh na mu nop ni uh ahing um ding, hinanleh na mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh amaun na kung uah, En un, khunah, En un, tanah, ahing chi ding ua, pei sih unlen, anua u’zong zui sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen tunphie vannuoi langkhat a aphiet a vannuoi langkhat tandong asalvah mabangin Mihing Tapa ahing pei ni chiengin tuabang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman sil tampi athuoh masa ding a, tulai khangthate deilouin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Noah damlai a sil umdan bangin, Mihing Tapa hing peikia chiengin zong a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Noah kuonga alut a tui ahing let a, a unpi ua amanthai ni uh atun masangsie, ane un, adawn ua, zi leh tain akinei ua, akiteng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachimabangin Lot damlai in zong a um a, ane un, adawn ua, alei un azua ua, tualeh a suon ua, alam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh Sodom khuo apat Lot apawt niin van akipat in meilekat azu a, abawn un asumangthai siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuamabangin Mihing Tapa ahing kilah ni chiengin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin koipou inntunga um in innsung a neitah umte la dingin kumsuh sih heh; tuamabangin koipou lou a um zong hing nuakia sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lot zi thei zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mi koipou ahinna humbitna sui in ataan ding a; tualeh koipou ahinna taan in ahumbit ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi, tua zanin lupna khat ah mi ni alum khawm ding ua, khat lahmangin a um dinga, khat nuasie in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nu mei ni ann sukhawm in a um ding ua; khat lahmangin a um dinga, khat nuasiein aum ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Mi ni loulai ah aum khawm ding ua, khatpen lahmangin a um dinga, khat nuasie in a um ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun adawng ua, akungah, “Heisungah e, Mangpa?” achi ua; Aman akung uah, “Shiluong umna phot ah langtate zong a um khawm ding uhi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman miten lungkelou a athum ngitnget ding uh ahi chi atheina dingun akung uah, gente thu khat agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khopi khat ah Pasian giinglou leh mihing zong bangma a simlou thukhen mi khat a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua khopi sungah meithai khat a um a, amanu khu akunga hing hawin, akungah ka kilanpipa tungah phuba hing lahpieh in ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh amapa hun bangtan ahiei a na ut sih a, hinanleh anuain alungsim in Pasian giing louin, mihing bangma’n sim sih nanleng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam meithainu’n ahing suhbuoi ziehin, aphuba ka lahpieh mai ding hi, tuachilouin ahing pei thithe dinga ahing sugim kha ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n, “Thukhen dihtat loupa thugen ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atung uah dawzou tadi nanlezong, Ami telte sun leh zan a Ama han mite phuba Pasian in alapieh sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi, Aman aphuba uh alahpieh pai ding hi. Hinanleh Mihing Tapa ahing pei chiengin leitungah tuabang ginna ahing muna diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh mi dihtat hi a kigingta a, mi dangte simmaw koite ahiei kung ah zong tam gentena thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mi ni Pasian biehinn ah thungetna nei dingin akuontou ua, khat Pharisai ahia, khat pen sie dongmi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pharisaipa adinga amatangin tambangin athum hi: Pasian, mi dang pauhat thu a mite neisa lahpiehte, mi dihloute, angkawmte, ahisihleh tam siedong mi bang ka hilou zieh in na tung ah ka kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hapta khat in ni vei ann ka ngawl a, Ka nei zousie sawm a khat ka pe leng hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh siedongmi khu gamla tah a dingin vanlam zong adahtou ngam sih a, hinanleh Aw Pasian, Kei mikhiel tungah zangai in, chiin a awm a tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hinghil ahi, akhat pen pa sangin tam mipa khu siemtang in a inn ah apei suhta hi. Michin ama leh ama kitawisang pouma a ngiem dinga, akingaingiem pouma tawisangin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipiten, ana thampieh dingin naupangte akungah ahing pui ua; hinanleh nuazuiten amu tahun aphawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n ama uh akungah ahan a, “Naupang neute ka kungah hing peisah unlen khaam sih un, aziehpen Pasian gam khu hichibang mite a ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chitahtahin ka hing hil ahi, koi hinanleh Pasian gam naupang neute banga kipahpi lou khu asungah alut vawtsih ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh vaihawm mi koi ahiei in akungah, “Siepa hoi, kumtawn, hinna ka tan theina dingin, bang ahiei ka bawl ding?” chiin adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akungah, “Bangding a hoi hing chi na hiei? mi khat chiloungal koima mi hoi a um sih, tua khu Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thupiehte na thei ve le: angkawm sin, tuolthat sin, gu sin, theipitu dihlouin pang sin, na nu leh na pa zatat in, chite,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman “Tamte zousie ka naupan lai a kipat ka zui sieng ahita,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n tam silte zousie azahtah in akungah, “Sil khat na sam nalai hi, na nei zousie zua inlen, mi zawngte kungah hawmpieh in, tuahileh van ah gou na nei ding a, tualeh hing pei inlen hing zui in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh aman tua thute azahin alunggim mama ta hi, mi hausa mama ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n alunggim mama chi amu bep in, “Mi hausate Pasian gam a alut hasa hina va-ia e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen Mi hausa Pasian gam a alut sangin, sangawngsau phinbil hawm a alut suoh abailam zaw hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh tam thu zaten, “Tuachi ahileh koi hundam in a um zou diei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman “Mihing dinga sil hitheilou khu, Pasian a dingin ahi thei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter in, “En vawi, Kouten bangkim nuasie in ka hing zui uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akungah, “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, Pasian gam zieh a, a inn alou ahiei, anu apa ahiei, asanggamte ahiei azi leh atate ahiei, nuasie khu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu damsung hun mama a ale tamzaw; tualeh hun hing tung ding a, kumtawn hinna toh mulou ding koima a um sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman sawm leh nite khu apui tuom a, akung uah, “Ngai un, Jerusalem khuo a hawtou ding ihi ua, Mihing Tapa tungtang thua guolneite thugel zou sie ahing tangtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama khu Jentelte khuta piehkhieh ahi ding a, chiemmui bawlna’n anei ding ua, zumhuoitahin chil aphit khum ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh avo ding ua, athat ding uhi. Tualeh nithum niin athoukia ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun tam silte atheisiem sih uhi, athugen khu alah uah phuol in a um a, thu kigente athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeriko khuo atun kuon un, mitto koi ahiei khat khutdawin lam gei ah atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aman mihonpi pei thawmging azah in, bang thu um atai leh chi’n adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun “Nazareth Jesu hing pei ahi,” chiin ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Jesu David tapa kei hing khotuo in,” chiin akikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n amasalam a peiten sip dingin aphawh ua, hinanleh aman “David tapa kei hing khotuoin chiin akihakou semsem hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu adinga, ama khu akunga hing zawpi dingin thu apie a, tualeh akung ahing tun tahin ana donga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Na tungah bang hing bawlpieh leng na ut ei?” achi hi. Aman “Mangpa mu thei ka ut hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesu’n akung ah, “Mu theita in, na ginna na dampi ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n thakhat in amu theita a, Pasian pahtawi kawmin ama azuita hi. Tualeh mi zousie’n tami amutah un Pasian aphat ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu Jeriko khuo ah alut a, apeisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai vawi, mi khat amin Zakai kichi, siedong lamkai lien khat a um a, ahausa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh aman Jesu khu mi bangchibang ahiei chi, mu atum a, hinanleh adin ngiem ziehin mipi lah ah amu thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin amasangah ana tai masa a, Ama en dingin theipi dawn ah akal tahi, Jesu’n tua lampi hing zui ding ahiziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu tuamun ahing tun in adah tou a, ama amu a, akungah, “Zakai hing kum mengin, tunia na inn a tungding ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n kintah in ahing kumsuh a, kipah tahin Ama azintunta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh tami amutahun, “Mikhielpa inn a tung dingin a pei tave, chiin aphun uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zakai adinga Mangpa kungah, “Ngai vawi, Mangpa Ka nei zousie akimkhat mi zawngte kungah ka pe dinga, tualeh mi neitah dihlou tah a ka lah a um leh ale li in ka sang ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akungah, “Tuni’n tam inn ah hundamna ahing tungta hi, ama zong Abraham tapa ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangthaite suidoh a, hundam dinga Mihing Tapa hing pei mawng ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tam thute angaikhiet laiun, Jerusalem anai tah zieh leh, Pasian gam hing kilang pai ding a angaituo zieh un, gente thu dangkhat agenbe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuazieh in Aman, “Mi thupi koi ahiei khat, a leenggam vaihawmna ding thu la a, hing kinuale kia dingin khuolgamla tah ah a zinkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman asuoh sawmte ahan a, akung uah, dangka mina khat chiet apie a, ka hing peikia masangsiein tamteng toh summet na bawl un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh amiten ama a muda ua, Tam mipa ka tung ua vaihawm dingin ka dei sih uh, chiin anua ah patong ataisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachia leenggam vaihawmna thu la a, ahing kinuale kia tahin, asum veipung dan uh, theina dingin sum apieh asuohte khu akungah ahan sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n khatnapa ahing pei a, Pu aw, na mina sawm in, kana pungsah hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman akungah hoi e, suoh gin um, tawmnoukhat tunga na gin um ziehin, kho sawm tungah vaihawm in pangin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n aninapa ahing pei a, Pu aw na mina nga in a pung hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman tuachimabangin akungah, nang zong kho nga tungah vaihawmin pangin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh midang ahing pei a, Pu aw, en in, na dangka mina tanah a um hi, khosanawtna puon in ka tun a kana kemtup chinten hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang khu mi gumtat na hiziehin ka hing giing hi, na koilou zong na lazel a, tualeh na tulou zong na at zel hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman akungah, nang suoh gilou na kamsuoh ngelngel in siemlou ka hing tangsah ding hi. Migumtat ka hi a, ka koilou zong ka lah a, ka tulou zong ka at zel na thei ngel ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahileh bang ding a, ka hing pei kia chienga a pung toh ka lah theina ding a, ka sum khu sum koina inn a na koilou na hiei? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akunga dingte kungah adangka mina khu lahpieh unlen, sawm neipa kungah pie un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, Pu aw aman mina sawm anei hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi koizong anei pouma pieh belap ahi dinga, tualeh koizong aneilou khu aneisun zong lapieh in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh tua ka galte, atung ua ka vaihawm ding deiloute hing zawpi unlen, ka masang ah that un, achi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam thute agen zouin, amasang ua pei in Jerusalem lam azuon touta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Bethphage leh Bethani khuo kung a Olive muol ahing tun un, anuazuite lah a mi ni asawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na masang ua khuo ah va “Pei unlen, na luttah chiengun, sabiltungnou koima tuonna ngainailou nava mu ding ua, tua khu hing sut unlen, hing kai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi koipou in, Bangdinga na sut uh ahiei? chia ahing doh leh, Mangpa’n atulmaw a hi, hing chita un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n asawlte khu ava peita ua, agen bang ngei in ava muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh sabiltungnou kikhina asut laiun, aneiten akung uah “Sabiltungnou bangding a na sut uh ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amaun “Mangpa’n atulmaw ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu kungah ahing kai ua, tualeh Sabiltungnou tungah apuonte uh apha ua, atungah Jesu atuongsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n apei lai in, apuonte uh lampi ah apha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama Olive muol kumsuhna ahing tun kuon tahin, anuazui mipi zousie in asil bawl thupi zousie amu zieh un akipah ua, aw ngaitah in Pasian apahtawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Mangpa min a hing pei kumpipa ahampha hi, van ah lemthu leeng henlen, tungnung pen ah thupina um hen,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh mipi lah a Pharisai pawlkhat in akungah “Siepa aw, na nuazuite phawh in” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aman adawng a, akung uah, “Ka hing hil ahi, tamte asip uleh suongte akikoudoh pai ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh atun kuon in khopi amu a, akakhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Aw! nangma mama in, tu na hun sung beeh in na hamuonna thu hing theita mai lachin maw! Hinanleh tuin na mit apat akiphuolta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na galten na kimvel ah leipal ahing tawkhum ding ua, pawtdoh theilouin na kimkotin ahing imkhum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n nang leh na sunga na tate tuol satna’n ahing nei ding ua, na sung ah suong khat beh kithuop in anuasie sih ding uhi, ve a na umlai nite na theilou ziehin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama Pasian biehinn ah alut a, sil zuate leh leite anotdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A kung uah “Ka inn khu thungetna inn ahi, chi gel ahi; hinanleh nouten gutate munpi in na bawlta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh Aman nichin in Pasian biehinn ah thu ahil hi. Hinanleh siempu liente leh laigiel mite tualeh mipi lamkaiten Ama tha atum chinten uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hinanleh mipi zousie in athugen angai nuom ziehun, abawl dingdan athei tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat Pasian biehinn a mipite thu ahil a, khantan hoi agen laiin, siempu liente, laigielmite leh upate akungah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh akungah, “Bang thuneina in ahiei tam silte na bawl? hing hil in” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman adawnga akung uah, “Ken zong sil khat ka hing dong ding, hing dawng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johan Baptisma khu van akipan ahiei, mihing akipan?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh akingaituo ua, “Van a kipan chileilah, ahileh bangdinga gingta lou, ahing chi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh mihing akipat chileilah mipiin suongin ahing sep ding uhi, aziehpen Johan pen guolnei ahi achi chiet uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun hei a kipat a hiei ka gen thei sih uhi, chiin adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Ken zong bang thuneina a tam silte ka bawl ahiei chi ka hing hil sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite kungah tam gente thu agen a, “Mi koi ahiei khat in grep huon abawl a, a huon kemmite kungah, kilaw a hou ding in apekhie a, gam tuom ah sawtpi tam dingin a hawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh aga law hun in, huon a grep gate ana pieh dingun lou houte kungah, suoh khat asawl a, hinanleh lou houmiten, ama ana vuo ua, khut guoh in asawlmang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman suoh dang khat a sawlkia a, ama zong ana vuo ua, zumhuoi tahin abawl ua, khutguohin asawlmangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman athumna asawl kia a, ama zong ana vawliem ua, adeldoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n grep huon neipa’n bangchi bawl ding ka ta diei? Ka tapa deitah sawl mai vang, ama beeh amu chiengun, ana zatat khamaw sih ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh huon bawl miten ama ana mu tah un, Tam mipa gouluo dingpa khu ahi, agou itan theina dingin that vai, chi’n akihou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n grep huon apat adeldoh ua, athat ta uhi. Tuaziehin grep huon neipa’n amauh bang alawta diei leh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahing pei ding a, grep huon kemte a sumang ding a, grep huon khu midangte kungah ape ding hi,” achi hi. Amaun tam thu azah tah un, “Tambang pen tun da heh” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Aman amauh a en a, “Ahileh tam thu kigiel bang ahiei? Inn lam mite suongdeilou pen tua suong mama khu, aning a suong poimaw pen ahing hita, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koipou tuami suong tunga pua khu akitatkehgawp dinga, tualeh akhiehkhum poumate a gawt guoi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin siempu liente leh laigelmiten Ama mat atum ua; hinanleh mipite agiing ua; tua gente thu amauh demna-a agen ahi chi athei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama khu abuhdap ua, gam uhpa vaihawmna leh thuneina a, atut theina ding un athu genkhiel man dingin midih kipang enkhemi asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh amaun akungah, “Siepa, dihtahin thu na gen a na hil zel hi, tualeh koima deisahtuom neilou in Pasian lampi dihtahin na hil zel chi ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kou dinga Kaisar kunga sie ka pieh uh sieng ahiei sienglou?” chiin adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman ze etna a adoh uh ahi chi athei a, akung uah, Bang ding a hing ze et na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Makhai khat hing ensah un, koi lim leh koi min atuong ei?” achi hi. Amaun “Kaisar a,” chiin adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Tuaziehin Kaisar silte Kaisar kungah pie unlen; Pasian silte Pasian kungah pie un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite mai ah athugen khiel mat ding amu sih ua, adawnnate lamdang asa mama ua, asipta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n thawkiana a um sih chi, Saddukaite pawlkhat akungah ahing pei ua, Ama adong ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Siepa, Mosi in koipou asanggampa’n zi anei a, ta neilou in ashisan leh anaupa’n azi aluo dinga a upa dingin hahlesuon anei pieh ding hi, chiin Mosi in ahing na gel pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n sanggam pasal sagi a um ua, a upa penin zi anei a ta neilou in ashi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n aninapa in aluo a, taneilou in ashi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n athumna in aluo a, tuachimabangin sagi in anei ua, ta neilou in ashi chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amauteng nua in numeinu zong ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaziehin thawkiana ni chiengin amanu koi zi pen ahita diei? a sagi un ziin anei chiet zieh un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu’n adawnga, akung uah, “Tulai khanga mite akiteng ua, zi leh tain akilatuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanleh khum hun chienga tel taah leh mishi lah akipat thawkiana tang taah a simtel pouma zi leh tain akinei nawn sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amauh shi zong ashi thei nawn sih ding uhi, aziehpen vansawlsiengte bang ahi ua, tualeh thawkiana tate ahizieh un, Pasian tate ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n mishite kaithawin a um chi Mosi in zong singbawh kuong thu ah, Mangpa khu Abraham Pasian, Isaak Pasian leh Jakob Pasian achi lai in alangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama mishi Pasian ahi sih a, mihing Pasian ahi zaw hi; aziehpen Ama Ngai in, mi zousie ahing ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n laigielmite pawl khat in adawng ua, “Siepa, na gendih ngel hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuami nua in thudang mawngmawng adong ngam nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Bangchi dan a Khrist khu David tapa achi uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama David ngel in zong Late bu ah, Mangpa’n Ka Mangpa kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />na melmate na kengngapna a, ka bawl masangsie ka ziet lam ah tou in, achi hi, ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />David in Ama Mangpa achi ngal leh bangchi dan a atapa hi thei ding ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuami nuain Aman mipi zousie zahin anua zuite kungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Puontuol sil a vah lunggula, van zuona munte a, chibai buh bang, kikhopna inn a touna hoipente leh pawibawlna a, mun hoipente deituom sese laigielmite lah ah pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Meithaite innsungte anegam ua, mi solna in sawtpipi thu angen uhi. Tam mite siemloutanna athupi sem ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuazou a Jesu adahtou leh, mi hausaten sum bawm a, silpieh akhieh lut lai uh amu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Aman meithai zawng tah khat in paisa san ni akhieh laitah zong amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman noute “Thutah ka hing hil ahi, tam meithainu zawng tah in, midang zousie sangin akhetam zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen tam mite zousiein anei valte uh Pasian adingin silpieh in apie ua, hinanleh amanu’n ahinna dinga anei sun teng apie hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi pawl khat in Pasian biehinn thu, suong hoitahte leh silpiehte a jep hoi ahidan agen uleh, Aman,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tam na sil mute uh ahileh, suhchip lou a, suong khat tunga suong khat kichieng mawngmawng na mu lou nite uh ahing tung ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh amaun akungah, “Siepa, Tam silte bangchih chienga hing um ding adiei? tualeh tam silte ahing tun ding chiengin bang chiemtena ahing um diei?” chiin adong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman “Sol a na um louna ding un pilvang un, aziehpen ka min suongin mi tampi ahing pei ding ua, Kei Khrist ka hi, ahun ahing tungta ahing chi ding uh hi. Tuaziehin amauh zui sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahivang in kidouna thu leh buoina thu na zah chiengun zau sih un, tam silte atung masa ding mawng ahi. Hinanleh atawpna ahing tung pai nai sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuazouin Aman akung uah, “Nam khat in nam tuom adou ding a, leenggam leh leenggam akidou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mun tuom ah zil nasatahin aling dinga, kielte atung dinga, natna hite aleeng dinga, van a kipat sil chizat huoipipi leh chiemtena thupi tahtah ahing um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh tam silte zousie atun masangin noute ahing man ding ua, Keima min ziehin ahing sugenthei ding ua, kikhopna innte a kipat in ahing kaikhe ding ua, suongkulte ah ahing khum ding ua, leengte leh vaihawmte masang ah ahing pui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute mai a Kei nang theipina ding ua hun lemtang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin bangchi dawn ding na hiei chi ngaituo masa lou dingin na lungtang uh sudet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na melmate zousie un ahing dou ua ahisihleh ahing soisel theilouna ding un, Keima’n kam leh pilna ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na nu na pate uh, na sanggamte uleh na be na phungte uleh na lawm na guolte uh nangawn in zong ahing kilepsan ding ua, na lah ua pawl khatte shina ah ahing tun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima min ziehin mi zousie muda na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh na lujang ua sam zamkhat zong amangthang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na thuohhatna un na hinna uh na humbit ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hinanleh galkapten Jerusalem a imchimit uh na mu chieng un, amanthai nading anaita chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuahun chiengin Judia gam a umte muoltung lam ah tai u’henlen, khopi sung a umte zong pawtdoh uheh, tualeh gam a umte zong khopi sungah lut sih uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen tam nite phu lahna ni ahi dinga, akigielsa zousie atangtunna hun ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh tua ni chiengin gaite leh naungeh nawitep nalai neite atung uh agih hi! Aziehpen gam sungah lungkhamna nasatah leh thangpaina tam mite tunga tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh amaute namsau hiemin ashi ding ua, nam zousiete lah ah suoh leh sal a puiin a um ding uhi. Jentelte hun a tunkim masangsie Jerusalem khu Jentelte totden in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tualeh ni leh ha leh aasite ah chiemtenate a um ding a, leitungah namte lunggimna leh mangbatna atung dinga, tuipite kihawt in amau veng vung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leitunga sil hing tung dingte ngaituona ziehin mite zauin ashibup ding uhi; aziehpen van silbawltheinate kikungnuh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin, Mihing Tapa asilbawltheina leh thupina nasatah toh, meilum lah a hing pei amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam silte ahing tun kipat ni chiengin dahdoh unlen, entou un, aziehpen na tatna ni uh anaita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah gentena thu khat agen a, “Theipi kung leh singkung zousie en un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anate ahing seltah chiengun, nipi ahing naita chi na mu ua, na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuamabangin tam silte ahing tun na mu chiengun Pasian gam anaita chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, tam silte atunkim masangsie, tulai khang thate amang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lei leh van amang dinga, hinanleh ka thu amang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Hinanleh pilvang un, tuachilouin nehva tahluot leh zukham leh damsung khosah ding ngaituonain, na lungtang uh aluodim seng kha dinga, tualeh tua ni na theilou kaal un, ahing tung zuai kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leitung pumpi a umte zousie tung ah, thang kipel banga thakhat a hing tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaziehin sil hing tung zousiete pel taah leh Mihing Tapa mai a ding taah dinga guotna hi theina dingun, kiveng unlen, thu ngen ngitnget un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Aman sun lai in Pasian biehinn ah thu ahil a, zan chiengin apawtdoh a Olive muol kichi ah ava um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n zingmawng matah in mipite zousie akungah ahing pei ua, bieh inn a athugen angaikhe zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Peikan pawi kichi, tanghou tolsawlou pawi ahing naita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siempu liente leh laigiel miten Ama atha theina ding uh lampi asui ua, mipite lah agiing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n sawm leh nite lah a tel amin Iskariot kichi Judas sung ah Setan alut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda Iskariot apei a, Siempu liente leh galkap lamkaite kung ah Jesu lebawl a amat sah ding dan ava houpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute akipah mama ua sum pieh ding athukimta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute thu achiem a, mipi umlou kaal a, Jesu lebawl a matsah dan ding hunlem asui panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n tanghou tolsawlou, Peikan pawi belamnou thana ding ni ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu’n Peter leh Johan asawl a, “Pei unlen, peikan annkuong ineh theina ding un, va bawl un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Heisung ah vabawl u’leng na dei ei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Ngai un, khopi sunga na lut chiengun, Pasal khat tuibel puo a hing pei na kituohpi ding ua, alutna inn ah zuilut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh inn neipa kungah, Siepa’n ka nuazuite toh peikan annkuong ka nehna ding uh mikhuol pindan heisung ahiei ahing chi hi, na chi ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman inndan tungnung lienpi guotsa diem khat ahing ensah ding hi, khunah hing bawl un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n apei ua, akung ua agen bangin avamuta uhi; tuachi’n peikan annkuong abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahun ahing tun tahin Jesu atouta a, sawm leh ni ten zong a toupi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Ka thuoh ding ka thuoh masangin, tami peikan annkuong noute toh nehkhawm ka ut mama hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noute ka hing hil ahi, Pasian gam a suhbukim ahi masangsie’n tami ka ne nawn sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n nou ala a, kipah thu agen zouin, “Tami la unlen kihawm un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen ka hing hil ahi, Pasian gam ahing tun masangsie’n uoin ka dawn nawn sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n tanghou ala a, kipahthu agen zou in abalkeh a, akung uah apie a, “Tami ka tahsa nou a dinga pieh khu ahi, na hing thei ngitngetna ding un, tami bawl zel un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuamabangin nitah ann neh zouin nou zong ala a, “Tam nou ka sisan a thuhun tha, noute dinga luongkhie khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh En un, ahing mansah dingpa khut, kei toh annkuong sawhkhawmin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Adihtahin, Mihing Tapa khu akiguotsa bangbangin apei zel ding hi, hinanleh lebawl a mansahpa tung agih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n alah ua tambang sil bawl ding koipen hi ding adiei chi amauh akidongtuo panta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute lah a koi alienpen a ngai ahi diei, chia kinielna alah uah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu’n akung uah, “Jentel leengte khu atung uah lal tahin a um ua, tualeh atung ua thuneite khu hoina bawlmite, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh noute lah ah pen tuabang na hisih ding uhi, tuanahsangin, na lah ua lien pen khu naupang zaw bangin um henlen, tualeh alamkai pen khu mi nasem bangin umzaw heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen annkuonga toupa leh anehbawlpa koizaw alienzaw diei? Annkuonga toupa alienzaw sih ding amah? Hinanleh keipen na lah uah nehbawlpa bangin ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh “Noute pen solna ka tuoh sungsie a hing umpite na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Ka Pa’n gam ahing pieh bangin, noute dingin gam ka hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka leenggam a ka dawkan a na neh ua, na dawn ua, tualeh Israel nam sawm leh nite vaihawmpieh a mangtoupha a na tou theina ding un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n, “Simon, Simon, ngai in Setan in busep banga ahing sep theina dingin ahing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh na ginna aba louna dingin, nanga dingin ka hing thumpieh hi. Kei langa na hing kihei kia chiengin, na sanggamte sudet in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in akung ah, “Mangpa Nang toh suongkul leh shina ah zong pei ka ngap hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman “Peter ka hinghil ahi, thumvei nang kitheimawbawl masangsie tuni’n aa akhuong sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Aman akung uah, “Noute sum ip bei a, thungpi bei a, tualeh kedap bei a, ka hing sawl lai in sil khat beh na kitasam kha uh amah?” achi hi. Amaun “Tasam lou” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Hinanleh tuin vang sum ip nei in keng henlen, tuamabangin thungpi neiin zong, tualeh namsau neilou in apuon zua henlen, lei heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aziehpen noute ka hing hil ahi, Ama pen dan botsete lah a simtel ahi, chia kigiel khu, ka tungtang thu ah atangtung ding mawng ahi. Kei toh kisai tam silte atawpna ahita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “En vawi, Mangpa tanah namsau ni a um hi” achi ua Aman akung uah “Ahun hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n apawtdoh a, abawl ngaina bangin, Olive muolah apei a, tualeh anuazuiten zong azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amun atun tahun, akung uah, “Solna a na lut louna dingun thungen un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Ama pen suonga sephahna tan dingah apei tuom a, akhupdin a, athumta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Pa aw, na deilam ahileh tam nou kei apat in ladohin, ahivangin Kei deina bang hilouin Nang deina bang hizaw heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng khat van akipat in akung ah ahing kilah a, Ama ahing suhat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama pen alunggim sengsenga, lunglut zaw sem in thu angen hi. Tualeh akhosa sisan khal lientah bangin leilah ah atakhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A thungetna apat ahing dingdoh a, anuazuite kung ahing tun tahin, amaute lunggimna zieh a gimgawpa imuin, amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuabepin akung uah, “Bang ding a imu nahi uoi? Solna a na lut louna ding un, thou unlen, thungen un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Aman tuabanga thu agen lai in, En vawi, mipi tampi ahing pei ua, Judas kichi sawm leh nite lah a khat in amauh ahing makai hi. Jesu tawp dingin ahing zuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n akungah, “Judas Mihing Tapa khatvei tawp a mat sah ding na chi hiven izaw?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Akim a umten sil hing um ding khu amu tah un, “Mangpa namsau in ka sat ding uoi?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tualeh alah ua mi khat in Siempu lien suohpa asat leh abil zietlam asatkhieh piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu’n “Tami bawl nawn sih un,” achi hi. Tualeh abil akhoipieh a, asudam ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n akunga hing pei siempu liente leh biehinn veng lamkaite tualeh upate kung ah, “Suomhatte man ding bang khop in namsau leh phohbul tawi a hing kuon nave uah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Noute toh nichin a biehinn a ka um laiin lah ka tungah khut hah na tum vawt sih un, hinanleh tuhun nou thunei hun leh miel thuneina hun ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ama amanta ua, azawpi ua, Siempu lien inn sungah apuilut uhi. Tualeh Peter in gamla sim ah anua agal zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tua huongsung leituol ah amauten mei ataw ua, mei awiin atoukhawm ua, Peter zong alah uah ava tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tualeh suoh numei koi ahiei khat in, meikunga atou laiin amu a, chientahin a en a, “Tampa zong Ama toh umkhawm aveleh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Hinanleh aman “Numei Ama ka thei sih hi” chiin akilepsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hun tomkhat zouin midang khat in amu kia a, “Nang zong alah ua mi nahi,” achi hi. Hinanleh Peter in, “Mihing aw, ka hisih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tuachi’n dahkal khat ding vel nuain, midang khat in, kimuongtahin, “Tampa zong Galili mi ahia, Ama toh umkhawm hima tham e,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Hinanleh Peter in “Mihing aw, na thugen bang ahiei ka thei sih” achi hi. Tuachi’n athugen laiin aa thakhat in ahing khuongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa khu akihei a, Peter a en a, tualeh Peter tuni’n “Aa khuon masangin thumvei na hing kilepsan ding chia Mangpa’n akung a agen khu a hing theidoh ta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter apawtdoh a hasetah in akap hut hut ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Jesu aman miten chiemmui bawlnain anei ua, a vuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tualeh amit atuompieh zou un, “Amai ah abeeng ua, Koi ahiei hing vuo gen in” chi’n a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tualeh thudang tampi zong Ama gensietna in agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Zingkhuo ahing vahtah in, mipite upate leh siempu liente leh laigielmite ahing peikhawm ua, tualeh avaihawmna masang uah Jesu ahing pui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />“Nang Khrist na hileh koute hing hil in” achi uhi. Aman “Hing hil nanleng gingta tuom sih va uteh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Tualeh ken zong noute thu hing dong leng na hing dawng tuom sih ding ua, ha zong nang hakhe tuom sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Tubansie Mihing Tapa khu Pasian silbawl theina zietlam ah atouta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute zousie in, “Pasian tapa na hi maw leh?” achi uhi. Aman akung uah, “Na gen bangun Ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun theisahna dang “Bang angai nawn tuon eimah? Eima ngeiin akamsuo iza chiet ta uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi zousie abawn un ading ua, Ama khu Pilat kungah apuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh amauten Jesu khu ahing hehse panta ua; “Tam mipa’n Khrist kumpipa ka hi chiin Kaisar kunga sie pieh ding akhaam a, Ka namte uh asuhbuoi dan ka thei uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in “Nang Judate leengpa na hiei mah?” chi’n adong a, Jesu’n adawnga, “Na gen bangin ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in siempu liente leh mipite kungah “Tam mipa tungah mawna ka mu sih,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh amauh ahapan semsem ua; Aman “Galili gam akipat tam mun tan dong in Judia gam khochin ah thu ahil a, mipite achiilsie hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pilat in Galili kiminlaw azah tahin tam mipa Galili gam mi ahileh hilou adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Herod vaihawmna nuoi a um ahi chi athei tahin, Herod kungah asawlta hi. Khum hun lai in Herod zong Jerusalem a um ahiziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Herod in Jesu amu tahin akipah mama a, atungtang thu tampi ana zahtah ziehin hun sawtpi a kipat Ama kimupi aut mawng ahi, tualeh asil lamdang bawl bang ahiei khat beeh mu akinem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akungah thu tampi adonga, hinanleh Aman bangmain adawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh siempu liente leh laigiel mite adingdoh ua, nasatahin aheh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabep in Herod leh agalkapten simmaw bawl in chiemmui bawlna in anei ua, tualeh puontuol thupitah asil sah ua, Pilat kungah anuasawl kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ni mama in Pilat leh Herod lawmta ahing hita uhi, tua ni masang in ama gel ana kimelma zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in siempu liente leh vaihawmte tualeh mipite ahankhawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Akung uah mite achiilsie hi chiin, “Tam mipa ka kunga na hing pui uh a, ngai un, na mai ua, hoitah a ka etchien nua in, na hehna tungtang uah, atungah dihlouna bangma ka mu sih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Herod in zong amu sih; noute ama kungah ka hing nua sawlkia a, Ngai un shina khop hiel in bangma abawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka jep sah ding a, ka ha mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />(Aziehpen tami pawi ni a mi henta khat ahakhiet sah teitei mawng uh ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh kituohtahin akikou khie ua, “Tam mipa sumang inlen, Baraba hing hakhiet pieh in” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Baraba pen khopi sunga helna bang ahiei zieh leh tuolthana zieh a suongkul taang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pilat in Jesu hakhiet a ut a, amaute kungah thu agenkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute akikou ua “Kross ah kilbeh in, Kross ah kilbeh in,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in athumveina dingin akung uah “Bangzieh in ahiei, Aman bang abawlkhiel a ahiei? Shina khop hiel atung ah bangma ka mu sih hi; Tuaziehin ka jepsah ding a, ka hakhe mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh amauten aw ngaitah a kikouin Ama Kross a kilbeh dingin, angen teitei uhi. Amaute aw leh siempu liente aw in avau daita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pilat in anget bang ua bawl dingin thu atanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh helna leh tuolthana zieh a, suongkul taang ha dinga angetpa uh, ahahpiehta a, Jesu pen amaute deina bangin apekheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaun Jesu apeipi lai un lampi ah Sairin gam mi khat gamsunga kipat hing pei aman ua, Jesu nualanga kros puohpi dingin, atungah Kross angata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihon tampi leh Ama suun a kap leh mau numeiten zong anua azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh Jesu akihei a amauh lam hing ngat in, Jerusalem “Tanute aw, Kei hing kaa sih unlen, nouma leh na tate ua dingin kapzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen Ngai un, miten chiingte leh nau pai ngailouna naubute leh naungeh tep ngailou nawite, hampha nah e, achi nite hing tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin amaun taangte kungah hing netkhum un, tualeh muolte kungah hing vuakhum un, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun tam silte sing hing nangawn a, abawl u’leh sing gaw ah bang akibawl tabep diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Migilou dang ni zong Ama toh tha dingin apeipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Kalvary achi mun uh atun tah un, khunah Jesu Kross ah akilbeh ua, migilou nite zong khat azietlam ah khat aveilam ah akilbeh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jesu’n “Pa aw amaute ngaidam in, asil bawl uh atheilou zieh uh ahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n apuonsil akihawm ua aisanna in anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mipiten dingin a en zing ua, hinanleh vaihawm miten Ama a elhou ua, “Midang bawn ahundam vele, Ama Pasian mi tel Khrist ahileh, Ama leh ama kihunkhe leh asih diei,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Galkapten zong chiemmui bawlnain anei ua, ahing pei ua zu pawng apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Judate kumpipa na hileh, Nangma kihunkhie in,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh alutung zawn ah, Greek leh Latin leh Hebru ham in, “TAMI JUDATE KUMPIPA AHI” chia kigiel akita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh migilou kikhaite lah a khat in Ama agensie a, “Nang Khrist na hileh Nangma kihundam inlen kou gel zong hing hundam in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh adang khat pen in, ama phawh kawm in, “Pasian nangawn ging lou na hiei mah? Mawtansahkhawma na um thei taven.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ei pen gawttah mawng ihia, isilbawlte man mu ihi, hinanleh Tam mipan bangma bawlkhiel anei sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Jesu kungah, “Mangpa, na gam na tun chiengin hing thei zingin achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesu’n akungah, “Adihtahin ka hing hil ahi, tuni’n ka kungah Pradise ah na um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh tam pen sunkimlai ahia, nitahlam nai thum tandongin gamsung pumpi ah simpi ahing zingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni ahing mielta a, Pasian biehinn a puongzah phal ni ahing kisuota hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesu aw ngai tahin akikou a, “Pa na khut sungah ka hagau ka hing kem sah hi” achi a, tami achi zouin ahagau ahata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Galkap lamkaipa’n sil umdante amu tahin; “Tampa pellou in midihtat ana hitahtah hi,” chiin Pasian aphat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh a en dinga hing pei mipite zousie in sil um dante amu un a awm uh tum kawm in anua pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hinanleh ameltheite zousie leh Galili gam a kipat a Ama hing zui numeite gamlapi ah ading ua, tam silte agal et uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tualeh Ngai un, mi khat amin Joseph kichi vaihawm mi a um a, ama mi hoi leh dihtat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aman avaihawmna u’leh asil bawlte uh lem ana sahpi sih a, ama pen Arimathai kichi Judate khopi khat a teng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tam mipa Pilat kungah ava pei a, Jesu luong ava ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Jesu luong alakhie a, puonnem in atuom a, koima kisielna ngai nailou suong kikhuoh han khat ah asielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuani khu kiginkholna ni ahi a, khawlni kipan ding ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Galili gam akipat a Ama toh hing zawhkhawm numeite’n zong anuazui ua, ahan leh aluong kisiel dan amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tuachi’n anua peikia ua, sil gimnamtui leh kinu ding sathau namtui abawl uhi. Tualeh thupieh dungzuiin, khawlni in akhawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin hapta khat a ni masapen zingmawng matahin agimnamtui bawlte uh tawi in, midang koite ahiei toh han ah ahing haw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaun hankhuh apat suong kiliakhesain amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n asungah alut ua, Mangpa Jesu luong amuta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh amaute tam thu a nasatah a alungbuoi lai un, ngai vawi, mi ni puon vam tesilsel sil in a kung uah ahing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute zau a leia abawhkhup lai un, amaun akung uah, “Bangding a mishi lah a mihing sui na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tanah a um nawn sih hi, athoukia ta hi; Galili gama aum lai a na kung ua agen khu thei ngitnget un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing Tapa khu mikhielte khut a matsah in a um dinga, Kross ah akilbeh ding ua, tualeh ni thum niin athoukia ding achi khu,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun athugente ahing theidohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n han akipat anuapei kia ua, tam silte zousie sawmlekhatte leh midang zousie kungah ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sawltahte kunga tam silte va hilte khu, Mari Magdalene toh, Joana toh, Jakob nu Mari toh, tualeh amaute toh umkhawm numei dangte toh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh athugente u’khu thu maimai bangin angai ua, atahsang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Peter adingdoh a, han lam ah ava tai a, kunsuh a hankhuh a et leh atuomna puonnemte maimai na um amu a, sil umdante lamdang sa kawm in inn lam ah apeikiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai vawi, tua ni mama in alah ua mi ni Emmau kichi khuo khat, zuon in apei uhi. Tua khuo khu Jerusalem akipat a tai sagi a gamla ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute gel khu tam sil hing tungte zousie genin ahoulim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabanga amautegel houlim a akikupkhawm lai tah un, Jesu mama in amauh ava nai a, amautegel toh azawhkhawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama athei louna ding un, amitte uh suhvai in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, na pei kawm ua, “Bang thu houlim a, tambanga daamel puo na hi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n amagel lah a khatpa amin Kleopa kichi penin adawnga akungah, “Tulai a sil umdante na theilou, Jerusalem ah nang maimai mikhuol na hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Bang sil umdante la?” achi hi Tualeh amaun akungah, “Nazareth Jesu, Pasian leh mi zousie mitmu a silbawlthei leh thugen guolnei minthangtah tungtang thu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama pen siempu liente leh ka vaihawmte un shi dinga mawpai ding leh Kross a kilbeh ding a, apiehkhiet dan uh thu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh kouten Israelte tankhepa ding Ama ahi chi ka kinem uhi, tualeh tamte chilou zong, tam silte hing tun kalsie tuni ani thumni ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuathamlouin ka lawi lah ua numei pawlkhat han a mataha va hawten ahing lungdong sah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aluong ava mu lou bep un ahing kinualekia ua, Ahing kiata chia hing hil vansawlsiengte zong ka mu uh, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka umpite u’lah a pawlkhat han ah ava pei ua, numeite gen bangbang ava mu ua, hinanleh Ama ava mu sih uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Oh, mi mote leh guolneite thugen zousie lungtanga tahsan hasa sate!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khrist in tam silte thuoh a, Athupina a lut ding mawng hilou ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh guolneite zousie laibu a kipat Pasian Laisiengthou pumpi a Ama tungtang kigielte akung uah ahilchienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n ahawna ding khuo uh atun kuon un, Ama pen gamlapi a peisuoh ding bangin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh amautegel in Ama ahou ua, “Ka kung uah taam mai ve aw, nitahlam ahita a, ni zong tum ding ahita hi,” achi ua, tuachi’n akung ua um dingin khuo ah alutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amaute gel toh annkuong a atou lai in, tanghou ala a, aguolzawl a, tualeh abalkeh a, amauh apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n amit uh ahing vahta a, Ama a theita uhi, tualeh Ama pen amitmu ua kipat amang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh amautegel akihoulim ua, “Lampi a ahing houpi a, Laisiengthou thute ahing hilchien laiin ilungtang isung ah akuong hiel hilou ahiei mah?” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuami hun mama in amautegel adingkhie ua, Jerusalem ah akinuale kia ua, Sawm leh khatte leh akung ua umkhawmte ava mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amauten “Mangpa athoukia tahtah ahi, Simon kungah zong akilahta hi,” ana chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh amaute gelin zong, lampi a asiltuohte u’leh tanghou aphalsuo a, Ama atheidoh dante uh ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tambang silte agen lai un Jesu mama alah uah ahing ding a, akung uah, “Na tung uah hamuonna um hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute achiza ua, azau sengseng ua, shiha muin akingaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Bangdinga hichi patau na hi uoi? Tualeh bang zieh a na lungtang ua ginlana hing um ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka khutte leh ka kephangte En un, Keima mama hilou ka hiei mah? hing tham unlen, hing vel un. Mishi ha in tua ka nei na mu uh tahsa leh guletaangte a nei sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tam thute agen zouin, akhut leh akengte amauh a ensahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh amauh akipah seng tahluot zieh ua, gingta ngamlou khop a lamdang asah lai un, Aman akung uah, “Tanah neh ding bang ahiei khat na nei uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, nga emminsa khat leh khuoizu khal khat apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aman tuate ala a, amasang uah aneta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Na kung ua ka um lai a, ka gen Mosi dan leh guolneite laibu leh Late laibu a ka tungtang kigielte zousie, tungkim teitei ding ahi chia, kagente khu tam thute ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n Laisiengthou thute atheisiemna ding un Aman alungtang uh avahsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman akung uah, “Tambanga gel ahi, tambangin Khrist in gimna athuoh ding a, ni thum ni a mishi lah akipat athawkia ding mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh kisiana leh khel ngaidamna khu Ama min in Jerusalem akipat in namchin lah ah gen ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Noute pen tam silte theipite na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ngai un, Ka Pa thuchiem noute tungah ka hing sawl ding hi; hinanleh tunglam akipat silbawltheina a thop na hi masangsie un Jerusalem khopi ah um khinkhien un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tualeh Aman Bethani khuo dongin amaute azawpi a, tualeh Aban azah a ama uh aguol zawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, amauh aguolzawl laitahin, Aman apeisanta a, van ah puitouin aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten Ama abie ua, lungnopna thupitah toh Jerusalem ah anuakiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tualeh biehinn ah Pasian phat leh pahtawi in a umdenta uhi, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
